Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:49.46,Title,0,0,0,0,,《雷霆沙赞2：众神之怒》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说告诉我们 只有少数勇士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lore tells us of a valiant few.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,能在战斗和迷雾之中屹立不倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}who stood above the fray and fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 他们一定是用了什么大杀器\N{\fnArial\fs30}My, what weapons they must have wielded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就要说到我们的展品了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which brings us to our current exhibit,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.17,0:01:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,神话中的那根众神之杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mythical staff of the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.79,0:01:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在荷马史诗中 这根神杖可以控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Homer's tale,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,并使用众神的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}the staff was said to harness the gift of all gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.97,0:01:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 光荣的士兵们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Welcome, proud soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.93,0:01:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过吧 博物馆充满乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I say? Museums are fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是大脑的精神乐园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amusement parks for the brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,淡定 不要推推搡搡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, there's no reason to get pushy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.56,0:01:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有机会参观\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone will get a chance to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.86,0:01:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是用两千多年难得一见的心材雕刻而成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carved from a heartwood not seen in over 2, 000 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.07,0:01:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件断成两截的古代制品\N{\fnArial\fs30}the two halves of this ancient replica were recently discovered in,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不久前\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all places,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.32,0:01:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在费城郊外的一座废物处理厂偶然发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a waste processing plant outside of Philadelphia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它非常坚硬 据说弄坏了三台垃圾压实机\N{\fnArial\fs30}So strong, they reportedly broke three trash compactors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.87,0:02:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面 朋友 不要乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um, friends, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家应该专心听我介绍 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, I'm sort of the star of the show here… Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.05,0:02:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.80,0:02:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你们要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.81,0:03:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unleash the chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.21,0:04:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 请放我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies, please just let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.56,0:05:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,博物馆确实非常有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out museums are fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再玩玩别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have more of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,神杖断成两截 我们什么都做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do nothing while the staff remains sundered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,人界继承者的数量远超我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The champions of this realm outnumber us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.99,0:05:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的继承者仍然是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human champions are still humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们是神\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万不要低估巫师的眼光和判断力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not underestimate the judgement of the wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.99,0:05:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保护众神的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect the power of the gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会以最严格的条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}he will have chosen with meticulous precision.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,筛选出这个世界前所未见的最强大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the strongest, most keenly intelligent champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.79,0:05:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,最具智慧的神杖继承者\N{\fnArial\fs30}this realm has ever witnessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.30,0:05:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是个傻小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.76,0:05:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我不配拥有这些超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't deserve these powers, if I'm being honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.22,0:05:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做什么贡献了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, what am I even contributing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个穿着红色战衣 绣着闪电的超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's already a superhero with a red suit, with a lightning bolt on it and I'm fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度比我还快呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有海王那身腱子肉 一看就特别爷们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aquaman is literally huge, and he's so manly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.85,0:05:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠也够酷 而我什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Batman is so cool! And I'm just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.07,0:05:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些话我没法跟人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't say this to anyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为家里人把我当领袖 可我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause my family looks to me as a leader, but I feel like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:05:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个假货\N{\fnArial\fs30}a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.11,0:06:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我只是个儿科医生吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand I'm a… pediatrician,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.87,0:06:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 另一个病人推荐我来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, yeah, well, you were recommended by another patient,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫比利巴特森 无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy Batson. It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我修复大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help fix my thoughts so that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我不再产生那些想法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}they just, like, you know, stop happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再说一遍 我不是精神科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look. And, again, pediatrician, not a psychiatrist,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 听上去你好像得了冒名顶替综合症\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it sounds to me like you're experiencing imposter syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.47,0:06:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常 这种病症源于童年时期的创伤经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}And often, that originates from trauma early in life,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.85,0:06:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if you don't mind me asking,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.39,0:06:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,童年的事你还记得清吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}how well do you remember your childhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,仿佛今天的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it was today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.73,0:06:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,创伤 不好说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trauma? Uh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I never met my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.24,0:06:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈在圣诞狂欢节抛弃了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, my mom abandoned me at a Christmas carnival.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.74,0:06:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在寄养系统中辗转\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent a lot of time in the foster system,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.57,0:06:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃离了十一个家 打架无数\N{\fnArial\fs30}ran away from 11 homes, got into a lot of fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后被一个巫师绑架 给了我超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I was abducted by a wizard who gave me superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.16,0:06:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后那老兄就在我面前死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then dude just, like, died in front of my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是小创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a small amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个博士召唤出七个恶魔 挟持了我全家\N{\fnArial\fs30}A doctor conjured seven demons and held my whole family hostage,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.13,0:06:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼得我们挖了他一个眼球\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we had to rip out one of his eyeballs,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后每个人都获得了超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then everybody got superpowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.67,0:06:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们各行其是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now everyone's kind of, like, doing their own thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我拼命想把他们捏在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm the only one trying to keep everybody together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 我们先处理好这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. Well, let's just process that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.05,0:07:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 你先是被父母抛弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? Rejected by your parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.89,0:07:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是寄养系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}then by the system,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.26,0:07:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又被你拼死保护的城市抛弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now rejected by a city you try to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说被我的城市抛弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never said I was rejected by my city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:14.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（被城市抛弃了）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.65,0:07:16.15,Title,0,0,0,0,,《宾州论坛报》 被城市抛弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Rejected by city."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.23,0:07:18.73,Title,0,0,0,0,,- 那是《论坛报》 没人看《论坛报》 - 我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the Tribune. Nobody reads the Tribune. - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.82,0:07:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, okay, well, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要感谢你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, appreciate your help,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.49,0:07:23.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（达里奥巴瓦医师）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.49,0:07:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我得去解决现实问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I got some real problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖分子劫持了一些人质 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this terrorist hostage situation going on, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.37,0:07:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 劫持了人质 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hostage situation? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:39.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（人质被杀 任务失败 再试一次）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.21,0:07:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打得太烂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suck balls at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.67,0:07:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么老打战争游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do we always have to play war games?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.59,0:07:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这是为其他工作练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's practice for our other job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.18,0:07:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.26,0:07:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,军事策略 多队员协作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Military strategy, multiple team members,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都有特殊技能 攻击未知的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}each with a special skillset unleashed against an unknown enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.81,0:07:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这很荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how it sounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:07:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可房子总是被闪电击中 不骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the house keeps getting struck by lightning, Leo. I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.36,0:08:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 你总是强调要团队合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, you're the one always talking about teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们不需要枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we don't need guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,达拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darla?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.07,0:08:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个 这可是大新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it. This is big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.37,0:08:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.37,0:08:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,达拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darla!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.91,0:08:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我兜里怎么有彩虹糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were there Skittles in my pockets?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.41,0:08:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,原本想给你个惊喜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was supposed to be a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.54,0:08:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是惊吓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.33,0:08:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她最近脾气很差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, she's very moody lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才给她彩虹糖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I put Skittles in her pocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.17,0:08:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.21,0:08:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是阻退成吉思汗的独角兽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this an army of unicorns killing Genghis Khan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,独角兽并不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unicorns aren't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫思辨历史 尤金 去查查\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called speculative history, Eugene. Look it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.39,0:08:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 你别走啊 角色会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, you can't just leave. Your guy's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.98,0:08:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看见了 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 你看了就会迷上它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you you would get into it if you gave it a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.48,0:08:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我感受到魅力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm really starting to see the appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:43.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马塞尔韦德 外场手 我们热爱费城 费城人队）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.32,0:08:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.25,0:08:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能发生紧急事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible 10-99 in progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.75,0:08:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,通报多起道路开裂报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Multiple reports of cracking on roadway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,桥梁悬索受损\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fraying suspension cables.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.67,0:09:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位前往本富兰克林大桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units to the Ben Franklin Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,音乐太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's crazy music, Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.17,0:09:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是 而且 主旋律非常紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, isn't it? Very urgent melody to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.59,0:09:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该去看现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should see it performed live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么想 我们能弄到门票\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking the same thing. I feel like we can get tickets to that concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,两张 也许不用 六张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two. Maybe not six.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.60,0:09:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,同进同退 这是规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}All or none. That's the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.68,0:09:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 还是老规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I'm still gonna walk backwards now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒退出去 所以 这是你最后的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now's your last and final chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.19,0:09:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利巴特森 跟我走 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy Batson, come with me. No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.73,0:09:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天费城的天气真好 谁想跟我去转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, it sure is a beautiful day in Philadelphia!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it though?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.16,0:09:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我快好了 - 又来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Almost finished. - Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.20,0:09:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 最好是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - This better be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂 你们去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa! Where's everyone going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.63,0:09:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,去打击犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}To fight crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.84,0:09:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 妈妈 - 再见 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye, Mom. - Bye, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见 罗莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye. - Bye, Rosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.69,0:10:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.48,0:10:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shazam!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.30,0:10:30.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（卡特里托斯椒盐卷饼）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.84,0:10:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,桥要断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna break!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.89,0:10:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.99,0:10:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我渴望一位英雄 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I need a hero ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.41,0:10:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我痴痴地等待英雄 直至长夜渐尽 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm holding out for a hero Till the end of the night ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:11:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他强壮有力 他身手敏捷 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ He's gotta be strong, and he's gotta be fast ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.08,0:11:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他要刚刚战斗归来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And he's gotta be fresh from the fight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.79,0:11:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我渴望一位英雄 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I need a hero ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.22,0:11:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way, shut up! Did I just save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.84,0:11:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听这首歌的时候我救过你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}while you were listening to this song?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫 我马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I got you, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.03,0:12:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,无需恐慌 全能大队长在此\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need to panic. Captain Everypower is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,开个玩笑 小事一桩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just kidding, it's real easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.97,0:12:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.26,0:12:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 有小猫咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh. Kittens!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! They're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.73,0:12:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢下我们不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she just leave us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.15,0:12:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:55.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（限速 谢谢）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.69,0:13:34.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（水族馆 卡姆登海滨）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.57,0:13:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 不 我来扶你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - No, no, no, I got ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的跟班 全能小队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my sidekick. Captain Everypower Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 小队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Junior?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可要抱紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna wanna hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.64,0:14:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.85,0:14:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 玛丽 全家集合了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome job, Mary. Circle up, fam!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.07,0:14:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 情况是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here's the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.74,0:14:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有一件事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have one more job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.20,0:14:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量阻止这座桥坍塌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's to keep this bridge from collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.33,0:14:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,本富兰克林大桥坍塌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ben Franklin Bridge has collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.62,0:14:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好在没有人员伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunately, there are no casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要归功于我们的英雄们 这是其中一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks in part to our local heroes, one with me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.29,0:14:33.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（14新闻频道 费城焦点栏目 突发新闻 本富兰克林大桥坍塌了）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸 南希 怎么说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's great to be here, Nancy. What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是日常工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all in a day's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说你们是费城的废柴 你有何感想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Well, how do you feel about being dubbed the Philadelphia Fiascoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.22,0:14:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是官方称号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given that that's not an official title,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无所谓 那不是我们的称号\N{\fnArial\fs30}we feel nothing about it. That is not our name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.14,0:14:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 重要的是群众都平安无事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, but the important thing is…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.93,0:14:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever no…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go check on the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 天知道他们在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you should. God only knows what they're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.94,0:14:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能在吸毒 或是在TikTok抽电子烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably drugs, right? Probably taking selfies while vaping on TikTok.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是小猫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a kitten?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:14.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（大桥坍塌 当地超级英雄团救了人 毁了大桥）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:19.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（基地）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.06,0:15:29.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（韦恩 暴食）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.98,0:15:32.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（温馨的家）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.81,0:15:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想叫你唐尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna name you Tawny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.69,0:15:38.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（有机化学）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.12,0:15:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁了大桥 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Destroy bridge"? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没保住跟毁是两码事 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not saving is different than breaking. Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:16:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们救的人 数都数不过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I wrong about this? Also, we saved countless lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.17,0:16:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,162个人 是有数的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred sixty-two. It's countable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.05,0:16:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩情是无法计算的 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emotionally countless, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.64,0:16:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Eugene?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.93,0:16:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟平时一样 在绘制密室门地形图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where he always is. Mapping out the Room of Doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.36,0:16:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 老弟 你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy! Where you at?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:23.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小心蜘蛛狗 青少年期）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.36,0:16:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.86,0:16:27.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（仙境 所有人 安全）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿 我们要开会了 尤金 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? We have a meeting, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.96,0:16:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.67,0:16:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万不要进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.51,0:16:45.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（噩梦燃料 成熟期）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 家庭成员们 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, fam-jam, let's jump in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:50.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（重点回顾）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.51,0:16:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 有功 也有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, big day, big bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.85,0:16:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯了几个错误 我们要反思这些错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}kind of a couple blunders, right? But we're gonna meditate on those mistakes right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.40,0:17:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.07,0:17:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在思考有机化学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Organic chem is my meditation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪你没有什么朋友 这很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said nobody with friends ever, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.57,0:17:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 如果上了大学 我就会有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}In point of fact, I'd have friends if I had gone to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.37,0:17:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In point of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.29,0:17:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不需要上大学的聪明人挂在嘴上的聪明话\N{\fnArial\fs30}is exactly the kind of smart thing that a smart person who doesn't need to go to college says.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们继续看回放\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let's go back to the tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.88,0:17:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 伙计们 看见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, guys, as you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.88,0:17:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一出场就非常非常有气势 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}we started off real, real, real, real strong, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 有凝聚力 有激情 非常棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right up top, all that cohesiveness, energy, terrific!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉教练 我得去飞飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry, Coach. Gotta fly IRL.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.97,0:17:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我还没完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, I'm not done with the presentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.26,0:17:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我喜欢你的每日回顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. And I love these daily recaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是晚饭前我得飞飞 松松筋骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just gotta spread my wings a bit before dinner. It helps keep me loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.56,0:17:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好 不回顾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine, fine. No recap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.77,0:17:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会儿我们一起去 好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go have a group hang in the air. That sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.40,0:17:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去测一下这种粘液的毒性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta test this slime for toxicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.28,0:17:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有刺痛感了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm starting to… tingle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.32,0:17:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,费城人队的比赛刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. The, uh, Phillies game just came on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我该去看棒球比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm gonna go ahead and, uh, watch baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得把唐尼送回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right that I give Tawny back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on! What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.41,0:17:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么都这样 我们要同进同退\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is happening right now? All or none, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.79,0:18:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说你得工作… - 我确实得工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you say you have to work… - I have to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.46,0:18:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作 你为什么要工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you even have a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,神奇女侠就没工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonder Woman doesn't have a job!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 你觉得她扎个马尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, seriously. Do you think she wears a ponytail and glasses…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.97,0:18:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴个眼镜就没人认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, like, nobody recognizes her…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.59,0:18:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后就能当个会计 - 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and she's, like, an accountant or something? - Just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把他们抓得太紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are holding on too tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.30,0:18:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪只是想单独飞行十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just 'cause Freddy wants to fly solo for ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.14,0:18:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会像你妈妈一样抛弃你\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean he's gonna leave you like your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.48,0:18:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我 只是想上大学 不是要抛弃家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or me wanting to go to college means I'm abandoning the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.19,0:18:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了 又是大学的话题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Okay, cool, it's about college again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.98,0:18:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是服了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I totally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.57,0:18:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的没想过自己吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Do you really not see yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.54,0:18:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过五个月你就18了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turn 18 in five months.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.04,0:18:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会赶我走 你也没被赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gonna kick me out. They didn't kick you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,维克多和罗莎都是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor and Rosa are saints, yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你即将超过寄养年龄 就像我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're about to age out of the foster system just like I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.13,0:18:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是是 我知道 我了解这个体系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I get it. I know how it works, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.80,0:18:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.09,0:18:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,维克多和罗莎快交不起房租了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor and Rosa can barely pay rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.76,0:18:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,州政府不再寄给我负担食宿的支票了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the state no longer sends checks to feed or house me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.85,0:18:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快你也收不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and soon there will be no checks for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.06,0:19:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管神奇女侠是否工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if Wonder Woman has a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.48,0:19:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想出份力 跟所有人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to contribute. At some point,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.98,0:19:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须找份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, like everyone on Earth, we have to get a job or…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.32,0:19:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是离开家\N{\fnArial\fs30}leave home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.24,0:19:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有永恒不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing lasts forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.13,0:19:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 这地方就叫永恒之岩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's literally called the Rock of Eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些东西是可以永恒不变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, clearly, some things do last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.25,0:20:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我安静地等死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.22,0:20:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带来了一件礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but we come bearing gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是魔法 这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic. Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.32,0:20:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界不能使用魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}This realm was sealed off from magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.40,0:20:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是你把魔法夺走了 包括我父亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. After you ripped it from our father's very core.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这个世界众神的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From every god in this realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.99,0:20:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.29,0:20:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得夺走了哪些吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not remember what you took?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.62,0:20:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了我的特殊能力是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What my particular power was?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我拥有大自然的力量 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The power of elements. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.26,0:20:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我设置了一道屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cast a barrier to prevent your kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.59,0:20:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止你们这些神进入人界\N{\fnArial\fs30}from entering the human realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.68,0:21:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏障消失的唯一原因 只可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way that barrier could be removed is if…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.18,0:21:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个东西断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone broke this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.31,0:21:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能 继承者在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did… Where is the Champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.85,0:21:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你亲手为我们的父亲炼造的神杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was your hands that forged this staff for our father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.06,0:21:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你的力量能修复它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yours that will mend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.65,0:21:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 宁死也不会帮助你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I would die before I help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.42,0:21:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 说出那个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.13,0:21:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,休想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never. Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.47,0:21:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要把话说绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never say never.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.27,0:21:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出那个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.61,0:22:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shazam!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.56,0:22:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以好好玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we get to have our fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.98,0:22:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩子才贪玩 亲爱的 而我们是在打仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fun is for children, dear. We are at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.55,0:23:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪 对不起 - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my gosh. - Oh, my goodness. - I am so sorry! - I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.47,0:23:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别道歉 是我不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't be sorry. I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.97,0:23:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我不好 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's totally my fault. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.01,0:23:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 那就好 - 我一直很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm okay, yeah. - Okay, yeah. - I'm always okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.72,0:23:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 你知道这地方在哪儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Uh, actually, do you… do you know where this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.02,0:23:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑德斯小姐 是的 我当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Saunders! Yeah, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.27,0:23:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才破音了 所以怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is what I meant to say. Voice crack. It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.52,0:23:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no worries. If it makes you feel any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.69,0:23:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉好就行 你现在脸红得厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's nothing compared to the amount that you're blushing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.94,0:23:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一自信就脸红\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I blush when I'm confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.49,0:23:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.53,0:23:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 新来的 第一堂课 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- New girl. First period. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.70,0:23:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫布雷特 这是伯克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Brett. This is Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.45,0:23:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你需要什么 就来找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if you need anything at all, we're your guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.33,0:23:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.25,0:23:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱耶兄弟 真的什么都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brett and Burke Breyer. They got it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.12,0:23:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,自恋型人格障碍 衣原体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what is it, narcissistic personality disorder, chlamydia, they got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.67,0:23:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都有 而且多到数不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plenty of it to go around, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位 霹雳咔嚓侠许愿小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Thundercrack's Make-A-Wish kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.30,0:23:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己觉得是个人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fanboy here thinks he's a big boy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.18,0:23:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道属于哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he doesn't know where he belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.55,0:23:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我不属于那个垃圾桶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure I do. I don't belong in that trash can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.51,0:23:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是一股人渣味\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause that's… I'll smell like human garbage,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.76,0:23:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻到吗 你们独有的味\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you realize that? And that's your brand, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.48,0:23:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗里曼倒下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down goes Freeman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.27,0:23:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.60,0:23:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在我是超级英雄了 - 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now I'm a superhero. - Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.73,0:24:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西怎么在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this thing doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.90,0:24:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,校工干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.20,0:24:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起来 你在做什么 - 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get up, man. What are you doin'? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.41,0:24:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己会修好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna want to get this fixed, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.53,0:24:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 因为它你才跌倒的 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, that's probably why you fell. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.54,0:24:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 新来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, new girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.70,0:24:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 盖可先生 - 别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jeez, thanks Mr. Geckle. - Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.79,0:24:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前那个垃圾桶就像我的第二个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}That trash can was like a second home to me when I went here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.84,0:24:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,明知道他们会打你 你还多管闲事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You knew those guys were gonna hit you, but you stepped in anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.80,0:24:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我自娱自乐的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know something? That's how I amuse myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.97,0:24:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我越搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The funnier I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.51,0:24:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就被打得越惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more I get punched.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.10,0:24:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我轻松多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it made me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.81,0:24:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.69,0:24:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.11,0:24:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.86,0:24:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能送我去上课吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna walk me to class, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.11,0:24:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么送你去上课 为什么 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I… Walk you to class? No. Why would I wanna do that? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.53,0:24:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.41,0:24:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 从头说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, from the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.33,0:24:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,霹雳咔嚓侠许愿小子是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is Thundercrack's Make-A-Wish kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.67,0:25:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 这是个内部梗 简单来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Um, it's real inside baseball, but basically,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.75,0:25:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久前我碰巧和几个超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}a while ago I happened to have some lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.55,0:25:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在自助食堂吃了顿午饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the cafeteria with a few superheroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.17,0:25:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.09,0:25:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个和超级英雄交朋友的孩子 就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the kid who's friends with superheroes. That was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.85,0:25:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 那他们还整你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - And they're still dicks to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.43,0:25:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜 你认识酷哥 不代表你就是酷哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly, just 'cause you know someone cool, doesn't really necessarily make you cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.44,0:25:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你挺酷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem pretty cool to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.02,0:25:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.07,0:25:21.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（烹饪艺术课）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.03,0:25:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.74,0:25:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我喊得很突然 很大声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, that was weird and loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.61,0:25:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫弗莱迪 这是用正常声音说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Freddy, he said in a normal voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.45,0:25:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫安\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.45,0:25:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.25,0:25:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 厉害 - 正中目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice! - Bullseye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.58,0:25:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该把拐杖修好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you gotta fix that crutch, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.50,0:25:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.32,0:26:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.58,0:26:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.50,0:26:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.50,0:26:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找到那个应该承担责任的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go find me the one responsible for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.77,0:26:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么想我很荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm flattered that you feel this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.52,0:26:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 我的意思是说看看这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truly, I mean, you know, like, look at all this, you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.57,0:26:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,浪漫的环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romantic setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.74,0:26:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,昂贵的香槟 大盘子小点心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fancy champagne, big plates, tiny food.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.20,0:26:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说诚意十足\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you went all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.74,0:26:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢 真的 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love that, I, I, I, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.66,0:27:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定是否做好了接受的准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just not sure that I'm really ready to commit right now, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.62,0:27:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 等等 不是你不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. No, this isn't about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.33,0:27:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 不是你不好 好吗 其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise this is not about you. Okay? Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.76,0:27:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道全世界都希望我们俩在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the whole world wants to see this happen. You and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.30,0:27:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,组个活力双雄 风情侠侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dynamic duo. The hottie goddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.64,0:27:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,神赞双侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}She-zam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.27,0:27:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我只是没有信心 害怕他们失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm just afraid that I'm… gonna let 'em all down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.27,0:27:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.44,0:27:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,害怕让你失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I'm gonna let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.36,0:27:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,管这么多呢 我们试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Screw it. Let's try.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.66,0:27:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂地试一次 也许我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try this crazy thing. Maybe we'll, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.83,0:27:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一吻就定情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}seal it with a kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.18,0:27:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利巴特森 你这个继承者是个大傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy Batson! You are a fool of a champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.97,0:27:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell… What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.02,0:28:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的漂亮脸蛋呢 你不是已经死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to her beautiful face? Also, aren't you, like, dead-ass dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.10,0:28:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来传达遥远世界的警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bring a warning from beyond your realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.36,0:28:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯的女儿们要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The daughters of Atlas are coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.36,0:28:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯的女儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daughters of Atlas?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.52,0:28:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们要毁掉你们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming to unmake your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.15,0:28:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们永生永世 遭受无穷无尽的折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}and torture mankind for all eternity in the Pit of Endless Agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.91,0:28:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我应该把这些写下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I feel like maybe I should be writing all this down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.03,0:28:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安静 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quiet! - Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.12,0:28:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你干的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.12,0:28:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真后悔当初选择了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret ever choosing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.21,0:28:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 隔离两个世界的屏障被打破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of you, the barrier between the world has been brought down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.88,0:28:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她们要来对付你 对付你的家人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will be hunting for you now. Hunting your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.80,0:28:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.38,0:28:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.89,0:28:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的世界危在旦夕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fate of your world depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.39,0:28:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一件事你绝对不能让阿特拉斯的女儿们得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing you absolutely must not allow the daughters of Atlas.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.39,0:28:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}to do is…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.62,0:29:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Freddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.05,0:29:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 没意思 干过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, over it. Done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.68,0:29:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,支票欺诈 胡扯什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check fraud? What, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.93,0:29:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,装甲车劫案 手到擒来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armored car heist? I think I got that in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.44,0:29:27.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蓄意破坏 野兽男孩）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.02,0:29:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shazam!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.95,0:29:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好胃口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bon appetit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.70,0:29:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨 你好 你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Oh, hi! Yes, I mean, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.79,0:29:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你想带我去那天坐的座位吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Um, you wanna show me where you were sitting when it happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.05,0:29:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 当然可以 - 来 跟我来 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah, of course. Totally. - Yeah. Follow me. - Okay, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.22,0:29:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 就是最后面那张桌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, basically, it's a table down at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.81,0:30:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时 当时我就坐在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I was sitting, yeah… Basically, I was sitting right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.31,0:30:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他坐在你那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he was sitting right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.27,0:30:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这儿 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here? - Right there, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.36,0:30:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 是我的霸道哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry. Overbearing brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.19,0:30:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姐姐也是一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I have one of those. Uh, a sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.32,0:30:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是问我在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always has to know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.94,0:30:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 我太理解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I feel that, clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.03,0:30:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还总觉得她更懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always thinks she knows better, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.53,0:30:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 即便事实证明并非如此 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Even when it's been factually proven otherwise? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.99,0:30:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我不爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not that I don't love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.33,0:30:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要不是 咄咄逼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course. It'd just be nice not to have someone…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.50,0:30:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,事事都要盯着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Constantly breathing down your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.21,0:30:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你一睁眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the moment you wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.33,0:30:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是小孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'm not a kid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.29,0:30:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 就比他小一个月 正好一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I'm a month younger, one month exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.67,0:30:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么都要在一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do we have to do every single thing together?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.42,0:30:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.13,0:30:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 比利 是你 这么巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Billy! What… What a coinkidink!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.93,0:30:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正跟我的朋友 安 说你有多好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just telling my friend Anne what a great guy you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.39,0:30:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.14,0:30:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈谈 他就喜欢谈 然后说个不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk. This guy loves to talk. He's a great talker.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.31,0:30:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.44,0:30:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我先去 马上回来 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to talk to him. I'll be right back. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.65,0:30:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说巫师解体了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, didn't you tell us the wizard disintegrated?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.82,0:30:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮肤剥落了 变成了一堆粉末 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The skin peeled off his face. He turned into a literal pile of ash. Yeah, seems definitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.32,0:31:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该死透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.20,0:31:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可是 在我的梦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Except now he's in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.54,0:31:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他向我传递信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, Freddy, he's trying to give me a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.33,0:31:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是星体投影能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be astral projection powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.91,0:31:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.87,0:31:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,像欧比旺克诺比死后连线你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi-Wan Kenobi-ing you from the great beyond?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.79,0:31:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 放学后召开紧急会议 - 你也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it, I'm calling an emergency meeting after school. - I want you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.75,0:31:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where else am I gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.50,0:31:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.67,0:31:19.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（全能大队长炸毁装甲卡车）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.84,0:31:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 首先 那不是我炸毁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, first of all, I didn't explode it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.14,0:31:24.35,Title,0,0,0,0,,我到的时候已经炸了 那是什么 《论坛报》\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? It was already like that and, and, and… What is that, the Tribune?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.51,0:31:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是假新闻 - 弗莱迪 我们只有一个规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's fake news! - Freddy, we only have one rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.81,0:31:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 同进同退 - 同进同退\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All or none. - All or none.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.97,0:31:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个规矩很烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's a stupid rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.89,0:31:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 有个女生愿意跟我聊天 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the way. I have a girl talking to me, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.23,0:31:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,女生啊 平生第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl. For the first time in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.02,0:31:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟她也许没有结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I probably don't have a shot in hell with this girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.06,0:31:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 如果你继续控制我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'll never find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.36,0:31:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不知道有没有戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you keep trying to control everything I wanna do!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.07,0:31:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记得来开会 弗莱迪 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just be at the Rock, Freddy. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.57,0:31:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 她有个姐姐 也是个控制狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, uh, she has a sister. Total control freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.33,0:31:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定合得来 没准还会爱上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you guys would get along. Think you'd love her, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.75,0:31:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 家人们 我知道这很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, look, look. Fam, I know it sounds crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.46,0:31:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, and obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.58,0:31:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道那些话到底意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know exactly what this all means.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.09,0:31:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他非常凶 声音很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, but he was super aggro and super loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.76,0:31:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为他想警告我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he was trying to warn us, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.96,0:32:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,乱七八糟说了一大堆巫师 神杖什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was yelling about all this wizard-y mumbo-jumbo about realms and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.05,0:32:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有必要这么大嗓门吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have to talk so loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.55,0:32:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 玛丽 跟他比差远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Mary, 'cause this is not that loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.68,0:32:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为这个音量在室内是可以接受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is a perfectly acceptable indoor voice volume.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.39,0:32:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 你还好吗 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is the deal? Are you okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.31,0:32:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么戴着墨镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have sunglasses on?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.65,0:32:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上去看眼科医生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you go to the eye doctor this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.07,0:32:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 看起来确实去看眼科医生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dunno, it looks to me like Mary did go to the eye doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.74,0:32:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过她昨晚确实玩得很尽兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was last night, and she had a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.57,0:32:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭心而论 我确实很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}In point of fact, I did have a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.57,0:32:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遇到了我的同龄人 我觉得很投缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met other people my age and I enjoyed myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.58,0:32:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在眼科医生那儿交到了朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made friends at the eye doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.91,0:32:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.50,0:32:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 言归正传 听着 他一直吼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, can we get back on track? Listen, he's yelling at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.75,0:32:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,说 阿特拉斯的女儿们要来对付我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's saying the daughters of Atlas are coming to hunt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.55,0:32:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我给你们念\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, check out what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.97,0:32:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯的女儿们是泰坦阿特拉斯的后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}The daughters of Atlas are the offspring of the Titan Atlas…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.13,0:32:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is obvious,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.43,0:32:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们的母亲 倪克斯 则是黑夜与死亡之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}but also Nyx, the Goddess of Night and Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.68,0:32:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上也有好事发生啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good things can happen at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.31,0:32:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,与死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And death.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.69,0:32:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看看手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.61,0:33:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,“女儿们守护着神话中的生命之树\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The daughters guard the mythic Tree of Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.65,0:33:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,树上结出的金苹果\N{\fnArial\fs30}which grows golden apples that contain the seeds of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.82,0:33:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,含有能孕育他们神界的生命之籽\N{\fnArial\fs30}which gave birth to their realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.24,0:33:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,守护它的是一条龙”\N{\fnArial\fs30}protected by a… dragon."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.41,0:33:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,打住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.83,0:33:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我突然精神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am suddenly here for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.17,0:33:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.17,0:33:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本来挺可怕的一件事 - 没想到还有龙 - 还有龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 'Cause, like, on one hand, totally terrifying. - On the other hand, dragon! - Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.96,0:33:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary. What are we doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.96,0:33:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 老弟 这是你的会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man. This is your meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.43,0:33:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错 可我们得达成共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yes, fine, but we all need to be on the same page.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.14,0:33:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且说实话 我一直觉得你们比我更聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, and, and look, I often think that you think better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.64,0:33:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫师没有给我一个详细的教程 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wizard did not exactly give me a tutorial here, guys, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.27,0:33:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿的很多东西我也不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, I don't know how a lot of this stuff works.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.40,0:33:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括那些密室门\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, that room of doors,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.98,0:33:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直燃烧的小提琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}or that violin that is, like, constantly burning which is super weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.82,0:33:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇怪 能让基地保持温度 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but also definitely keeps the lair cozy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.11,0:33:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至没告诉我应该叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't even tell me my superhero name.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.91,0:33:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是没有努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not like I'm not tryin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.20,0:33:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的需要大家帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I really, really need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.79,0:33:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识个人 也许能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I might know somebody that can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.38,0:34:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 这东西能亮吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. That lights up?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.51,0:34:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.46,0:34:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忙着绘制整个基地的地形 你却瞒着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm mapping out the entire lair and you withhold this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.71,0:34:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都被蒙在鼓里了 你可真行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have really been holding out on us. Jeez Louise, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.26,0:34:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.64,0:34:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇什么 怎么了 - 快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Whoa" what? "Whoa" what? - Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.85,0:34:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.52,0:34:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你管它叫史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You call the pen "Steve"?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.35,0:34:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 跟它很配\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I thought he looked like a "Steve."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.94,0:35:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实挺斯文的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He totally looks like a "Steve".
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.73,0:35:03.56,Title,0,0,0,0,,（罪与罚》读书报告 作者 佩德罗佩尼亚）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.65,0:35:05.36,Title,0,0,0,0,,《罪与罚》的读书报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Crime and Punishment", a book report.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.44,0:35:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 作者佩德罗佩尼亚 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "by Pedro Pena?" - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.57,0:35:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩德罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.61,0:35:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,老弟 这是作弊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, that's cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.20,0:35:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它什么都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he knows everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.41,0:35:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不信你问它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously. Ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.08,0:35:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,问什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can just ask him stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.08,0:35:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.16,0:35:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么拽 厉害呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slick. Okay, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.16,0:35:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫 我们想找一些有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve, we're looking for information.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.83,0:35:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯女儿们的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the daughters of Atlas.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.83,0:35:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮个忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you please help us with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.00,0:35:26.96,Title,0,0,0,0,,（希腊叛乱》第三卷）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.05,0:35:28.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巫师理事会）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.13,0:35:29.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（凡人的审判）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.22,0:35:30.43,Title,0,0,0,0,,（神谱》第七卷）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.51,0:35:31.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（神界的植物和动物）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.18,0:35:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是书名\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are book titles.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.26,0:35:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们去找找这些书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's just all pick a book, or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.60,0:35:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Freddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.60,0:35:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,晦涩的神秘学 绝对是他擅长的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, obscure mythology? Definitely his thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.27,0:35:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.23,0:35:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪还知不知道他擅长什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy knows what his thing is anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.94,0:35:43.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（神界的植物和动物）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.03,0:35:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没上来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I've actually never, never been up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.57,0:35:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.03,0:35:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你跟超级英雄聚会的地方 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where you hang out with your superhero friends, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.91,0:35:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 他们来这儿干什么 没事干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually, why would they ever have to… Why would they ever come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.99,0:35:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来过 是的 是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean they have, yes, they've driven by…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.45,0:36:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的认识他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you actually know those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.46,0:36:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是杜撰出来的加拿大女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is this like a "Canadian girlfriend" situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.63,0:36:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说柯莱特吗 我和她还没确定关系呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean Collette? Well, she and I aren't really exclusive, as of now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.88,0:36:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想见一个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna meet one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.43,0:36:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么个见法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet, like how?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.72,0:36:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对面 就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, face-to-face, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.26,0:36:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就当你同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take that as a yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.68,0:36:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是你的幸运日 我打给最性感的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And today is your lucky day, because I'm gonna call the hot one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.14,0:36:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.10,0:36:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 性感的男人 - 他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, the male hot one. - Him?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.23,0:36:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吗 - 这是很主观的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? Him? - Look, I mean, it's all subjective, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.52,0:36:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是全能大队长更受网民关注\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, um… Captain Everypower usually tops most online polls.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.82,0:36:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so… It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.53,0:36:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是玩笑吗 弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a joke, Freddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.53,0:36:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我并不是要你证明什么 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I didn't mean to make you actually prove it, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.79,0:36:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不是玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.16,0:36:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就给他打电话 现在就打 别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna call him right now. I'm gonna call him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.38,0:36:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, don't move. So, stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.50,0:36:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 全能大队长 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Captain Everypower. What's goin' on?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.76,0:36:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是弗莱迪 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your boy Freddy. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.30,0:36:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我救过你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that time I saved your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.72,0:36:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是另一次 对 还我个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, the other time. Yeah. Well, I'm calling in that favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.69,0:37:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是安吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.69,0:37:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.36,0:37:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪说你们是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friend of Freddy's, I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.11,0:37:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们是朋友 你怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am, actually. Yeah. How are you…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.29,0:37:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是因为拥有超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I may be the one with the superpowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.04,0:37:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那个孩子 他是真正的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that kid, he's the real hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.67,0:37:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 说实话 我从没见过他那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I mean, honestly, I've never met anyone like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.75,0:37:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很真诚 很温暖 很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's… genuine and warm and funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.88,0:37:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你夸了好多优点 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a lot of nice things. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.14,0:37:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们怎么认识的 - 在漫展上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you two meet? - Comic Con.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.97,0:37:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么是漫展 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's Comic Con? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.81,0:37:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本书上说 众神只把人类当成奴仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to this, gods considered humans servants,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.44,0:37:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,供他们玩弄的玩具 该受罚的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}toys to be played with, children to be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.40,0:37:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.36,0:37:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到叛乱发生 人类开始反抗众神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until the rebellion when the humans turned on the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.95,0:37:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正好读到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm reading about that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.24,0:38:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以很显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.28,0:38:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切围绕一种强大的武器展开\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of this revolves around a powerful weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.33,0:38:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Atlas, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.50,0:38:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是阿特拉斯女儿们的父亲 很明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}the father of the daughters of Atlas, obviously, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.42,0:38:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用生命之树制作了一根神杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}he crafted a quarterstaff from the Tree of Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.58,0:38:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,并用那根神杖将力量赋予某些神\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he used that staff to give powers to certain deities.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.21,0:38:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 也能用来夺走其他神的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}but also to take powers away from others.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.13,0:38:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这根神杖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the staff's where.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.34,0:38:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,保存了阿特拉斯所有的超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlas stored all supernatural power.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.43,0:38:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 说得没错 就像一块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, exactly. It's like a,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.97,0:38:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,储存魔法的电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}a battery for magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.47,0:38:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是后来发生了变故\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when things got bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.14,0:38:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类巫师理事会的成员联合起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}a council of human wizards got together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.39,0:38:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,从阿特拉斯那里偷走了神杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they stole the staff from Atlas.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.77,0:38:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,并用它夺走了他的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they used that to take his powers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.90,0:38:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了他的魔法 他们又向其他神下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once they had his magic they went after other gods…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.86,0:38:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个巫师 我认识他 我认识这个巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, that's the wizard! I know this guy, this is the wizard that I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.53,0:38:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这写的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do these say?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.20,0:38:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,“所罗门的智慧 海格力斯的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Wisdom of Solomon,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.70,0:38:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯的毅力 宙斯的威力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strength of Hercules, Stamina of Atlas,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.95,0:38:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基里斯的勇气 墨丘利的神速”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power of Zeus, Courage of Achilles,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.75,0:38:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们窃取了这些力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speed of Mercury." These are the powers they stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.75,0:38:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.67,0:38:54.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（所罗门的智慧 海格力斯的力量 阿特拉斯的毅力 宙斯的威力 阿基里斯的勇气 墨丘利的神速）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.30,0:38:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来沙赞是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, guys, look! This is what the name means.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.63,0:38:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可比我想的酷多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is way cooler than what I thought it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.88,0:38:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我还觉得有点儿掉价呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is just a bunch of hot garbage, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.43,0:39:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I may point out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.39,0:39:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个超能力可能下落不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of the powers that may be possibly MIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.89,0:39:05.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（所罗门的智慧 海格力斯的力量）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.18,0:39:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你真是毫不委婉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, are you very unsubtly implying.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.93,0:39:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常直接地暗示我缺乏所罗曼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I somehow lack the wisdom of.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.40,0:39:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 智慧吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Solo Man? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.81,0:39:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有可能是大器晚成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe it comes later.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.82,0:39:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可你通常都会问玛丽该怎么办 - 就是说说 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean you do usually ask Mary what to do. - I'm just saying. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.03,0:39:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话太伤人了 希望你们能明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is very, very hurtful. I just want you all to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.57,0:39:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确发音是所罗门\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's pronounced "Solomon."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.16,0:39:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.53,0:39:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么发现 家人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else have we learned, fam?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.20,0:39:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那个神杖汲取了众神之力以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, once the staff contained the powers of the gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.75,0:39:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类巫师们接下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}the wizards apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.83,0:39:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,又用某种魔法结界把整个神界包围起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}encased the God Realm in some magical sphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.09,0:39:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,将其永远封印 与魔法隔绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}sealing it away forever. Cut off from magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.26,0:39:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so that's what that was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.51,0:39:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他们现在好像没那么与世隔绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't think that they are so cut off anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.97,0:39:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.89,0:39:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,希腊雅典上演了离奇又可怕的一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}and gruesome scene unfolded in Athens, Greece this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.60,0:39:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个穿着类似古希腊铠甲的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two women dressed in what appears to be ancient Greek…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.02,0:39:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是巫师的神杖 怎么在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa, that's the wizard's staff. How did they get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.98,0:39:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些雕像都是活人变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, all those statues used to be people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.78,0:39:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好奇的是 那个神杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm wondering, how did the staff end up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.86,0:40:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么在欧洲而且是希腊\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Europe, where Greece is at?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.24,0:40:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 先生 抱歉拿了您的手杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, gee-whiz, mister, sorry I took your cane.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.66,0:40:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要回去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.92,0:40:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实把它弄断以后扔掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I did break it in half and then throw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.08,0:40:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定那就是这一切的缘由 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's probably where the journey started. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.67,0:40:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.59,0:40:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么什么 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "What?" What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.92,0:40:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把它扔那儿了 - 我们都在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You just left it there? - We were all there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.67,0:40:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 我拿到神杖 给了你们超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I had a staff. I gave you all superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.97,0:40:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不用感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.30,0:40:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我也只能把它断成两截\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I had to break it in half so Sivana didn't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.26,0:40:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得希瓦纳再做坏事 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}super bad-guy stuff with it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.18,0:40:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄断了神杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke the staff,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.52,0:40:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就打破了两个世界之间的屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}meaning you broke the barrier between worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.69,0:40:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在刚刚知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which we now know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.02,0:40:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们还知道她们长什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We also now know what they look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.52,0:40:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等她们找来时 我们就知道是她们… - 三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So when they come to hunt us, we'll see those two coming a… - Three. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.57,0:40:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯有三个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlas had three daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.49,0:40:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡吕普索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kalypso,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.95,0:40:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫斯佩拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hespera,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.62,0:40:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,安西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthea.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.91,0:40:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,安西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne… thea.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.50,0:40:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不仅仅是超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm not just a superhero.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.25,0:40:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是最佳听众\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a super listener.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.42,0:41:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… I sense…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.55,0:41:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你对弗莱迪有好感\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you may have feelings for Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.09,0:41:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么时候回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanna know when he's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.14,0:41:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让他受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't want him to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.39,0:41:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, Anne…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.68,0:41:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们选择不了自己会为谁心动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we can't choose the people we fall for.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.23,0:41:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.98,0:41:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的不是那种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.69,0:41:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他现在出现 处境会很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he shows up now, he's in serious danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.07,0:41:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧我是谁 谁能危及我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Look who you're with. What could possibly be dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.36,0:41:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.24,0:41:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我算看明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I see how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.20,0:41:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,比划比划吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.08,0:41:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.04,0:41:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.38,0:41:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪 我不知道是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Freddy, I, I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.88,0:41:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没想过伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never meant for you to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.09,0:41:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,要受伤的人不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm not the one who's gonna get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.05,0:41:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shazam!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.59,0:41:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙赞 沙赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shazam! Shazam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.93,0:41:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是怎么回事 - 老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on up here? - Mis…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.02,0:41:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.23,0:41:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快进去 进去 盖可老师 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back inside. Just get back inside, Mr. Geckle. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.39,0:41:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.48,0:41:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁 学生家长吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? Do you have kids here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.65,0:42:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么 别动他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Don't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.90,0:42:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会碰他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.65,0:42:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.99,0:42:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.91,0:42:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖可老师 她说什么 你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. G. Wha… What did she say? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.37,0:42:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.34,0:42:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么 不不不 快停下 快停下 别走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you… no, no, no! Stop, stop, stop! Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.55,0:42:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 小心 别过去 不要 不不不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no, no, no! Wait, no, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.84,0:42:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}no!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.18,0:42:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘了他们有多容易爆裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot how easily they burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.10,0:42:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.47,0:42:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像葡萄一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.40,0:42:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the… Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.33,0:42:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 孩子 告诉我们其他人在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, child, tell us where to find the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.75,0:42:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.59,0:43:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,剪掉他的翅膀 安西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clip his wings, Anthea.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.25,0:43:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.00,0:43:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are more.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.59,0:43:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,来得刚好 把他们干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. We take them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.63,0:43:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那不是来的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's not why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.22,0:43:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,先找生命之籽 放弃吧 姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here for the seed of life. Yield, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.56,0:43:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须按计划行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stick to the plan we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.35,0:43:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲永远不会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father would never yield.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.64,0:44:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是父亲已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Father is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.27,0:44:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得摆正自己的位置 妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you know your place, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.02,0:44:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就教教你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I will show it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.32,0:44:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,按我们的方式来 不是他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do this our way, not theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.04,0:44:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别轻举妄动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make one move…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.21,0:44:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我拧断这孩子的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will snap this child's neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.66,0:44:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.66,0:45:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.55,0:45:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.74,0:45:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.74,0:45:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们要用神杖夺走我们的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're using the staff to take our powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.63,0:45:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.23,0:46:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.94,0:46:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你 你快逃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I'm sorry, just, just save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.32,0:46:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行 同进同退 我们要团结\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, all or none. We stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.03,0:46:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会如愿的 因为你哪儿都去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that you will because you cannot leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.95,0:46:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也尝尝被困在衰亡世界里是什么滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see how you like being sealed off in a dying world.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.87,0:46:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.04,0:46:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.38,0:46:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,从市区北部的市行大道\N{\fnArial\fs30}From City Line Avenue in the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.26,0:46:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,到斯库尔基尔河的西岸 至卡波斯河\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the western shore of the Schuylkill River to Cobbs Creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.64,0:46:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫名其妙地出现了一个穹顶状的不明屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}The unidentified barrier appears to be in the shape of a dome.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.60,0:46:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断了所有人进出城市的通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}with no one allowed into the city or out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.81,0:46:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时 有观点认为 这起奇异的魔法事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}with some suggesting this strange magical element.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.27,0:46:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能直接或者间接地\N{\fnArial\fs30}may be the doing, or undoing,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.11,0:46:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,出自费城的废柴们的手笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Philadelphia Fiascoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.17,0:47:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的天 - 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holy sh… - Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.59,0:47:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这儿刚要睡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.22,0:47:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是逃离折磨的唯一途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the only escape from the tortures here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.85,0:47:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 真惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Bleak.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.48,0:47:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.27,0:47:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格的胡子 蝙蝠侠的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hagrid beard, Batman voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.94,0:47:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是巫师 那个巫师 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the wizard. You're the wizard! Oh, my…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.07,0:47:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又活了 比利跟我说过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're back! Billy told me all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.69,0:47:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 你认识比利巴特森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy? You know Billy Batson?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.95,0:47:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利巴特森是我最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy Batson. Yeah, he's my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.36,0:47:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是弗莱迪弗里曼 全能大队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… I'm Freddy Freeman, Captain Everypower.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.37,0:47:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说曾经是 这事很复杂 她很复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, used to be. It's complicated now. She… It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.62,0:47:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利那个蠢货把沙赞的力量传给了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That halfwit Billy gave you the powers of Shazam?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.62,0:47:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他还说你变成了灰烬 可 可是你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he did. And he said that you turned into ash, but, but didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.75,0:47:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把力量给了他 就不能留在我的法界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once I gave him the power, I could no longer remain in my realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.71,0:47:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,被困在这间牢房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But death would have been a luxury.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.26,0:48:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对一败涂地的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}compared to being trapped in this cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.38,0:48:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对你 死亡变成了一种奢求\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the knowledge of my failure, and with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.97,0:48:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.10,0:48:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,比比利说话更爱挖苦人 可是没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little more sarcastic than Billy said, but, hey, all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.10,0:48:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开这儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.10,0:48:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开这儿吧 你想得美\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Let's just get out of here." Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.64,0:48:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不那样说话 无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sound nothing like that, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.40,0:48:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what we've got, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.56,0:48:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个阴阳怪气的暴脾气巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cranky wizard with a cynical streak.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.19,0:48:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个在魔法方面无所不知的早熟少年\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a precocious young man with an encyclopedic knowledge regarding magical shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.15,0:48:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那三姐妹绝对不可能困得住我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no way these sisters are keeping us in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.24,0:48:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些栏杆可能被施了魔法 你会什么咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}These prison bars, they're probably enchanted! What spells do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.20,0:48:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你把嘴闭上 - 奥术专注你会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, stop talking. - How about an arcane focus?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.62,0:48:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连那是什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.42,0:48:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 那就做药水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, then let's make a potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.63,0:48:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如能获得巨人之力的药水或是缩小药水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a potion of, um, giant strength or diminution.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.30,0:48:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 气化形体 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Gaseous form!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.67,0:48:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们能像屁一样飘走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Maybe we could float out of here like a fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.55,0:48:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我竟然把力量给了一群肆意挥霍的小屁孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave my powers to children who squandered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.10,0:48:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩会死在这儿 弗里比\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will die here, Freeby.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.26,0:48:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒一下 是弗莱迪 弗里比 你怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Freddy, by the way."Freeby"? Where do you even…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.77,0:48:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越早接受事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sooner you accept it,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.06,0:48:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就越能轻松面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}the easier it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.35,0:48:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是牙吗 这里有一颗牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a tooth? There's a tooth in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.20,0:49:07.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（自然之力 混沌之力）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.49,0:49:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,“她们拥有自然之力 混沌之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Power of elements. Power of chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.24,0:49:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还拥有轴心之力”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power of axis."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.46,0:49:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些全都是上古神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are primordial forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.17,0:49:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道我们该怎么才能与之对抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how we fight powers like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.08,0:49:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你怎么对抗 谁的智慧来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you how we fight it. With the wisdom of…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.25,0:49:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所罗门 - 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Solomon. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.63,0:49:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我们来安排一场会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, we set up a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.55,0:49:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错 告诉她们我们要谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we tell 'em we want to negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.05,0:49:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,提出用我们的力量换弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Offer up our powers for Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.22,0:49:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后趁机抓住她们其中的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then we grab one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.10,0:49:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是真正的筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's what we really use to trade!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.98,0:49:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她们窃取我们的力量呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if they steal our powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.56,0:49:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they won't,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.56,0:49:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经了解她们的路数了 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we know how they work now. You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.06,0:49:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她们把神杖对准我们 那就快躲\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they just point that staff at us, we dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.40,0:49:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲避球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like dodgeball.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.49,0:49:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我躲避球玩得很烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I suck at dodgeball.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.49,0:49:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许佩德罗不擅长躲避球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe Pedro sucks at dodgeball,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.20,0:49:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级佩德罗可不一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not Super Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.24,0:49:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 超级佩德罗 躲避球也一样烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Super Pedro also sucks at dodgeball.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.03,0:49:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着 我们有五个人 她们只有三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Listen, all I know is that there's five of us and three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.08,0:49:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我认为 我们应该发出邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think we should send them a little invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.96,0:50:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 据史蒂夫说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.34,0:50:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一摞纸都是有神奇魔力的羊皮纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Steve says that this paper is a stack of magical parchment.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.34,0:50:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要在魔法纸上写下留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}You write a message on the magical paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.34,0:50:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后对它说出你想与之交谈的神的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}and say the name of the god that you would like to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.59,0:50:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这张纸会折叠成…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then the paper folds into a…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.68,0:50:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.60,0:50:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只小小纸鸟 而且会飞向那个神\N{\fnArial\fs30}A paper bird. And it flies to the god.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.94,0:50:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挺可爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's kinda cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.98,0:50:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 那半神可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what about demigods?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.61,0:50:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 比方说 神奇女侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you know, like, Wonder Woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.90,0:50:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得她现在能收到飞鸟传信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think she's accepting bird letters right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.49,0:50:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这支笔耸肩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the pen just shrug?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.95,0:50:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 史蒂夫 我只能写给…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Steve, do I just dictate to…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.79,0:50:33.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（是的）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.79,0:50:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我明白了 揉成团 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do. Okay, cool, wad that up. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.33,0:50:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,写信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letter…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.25,0:50:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,写信 写一封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letter, writing a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.34,0:50:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 不是 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.26,0:50:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我随口说说而已 不是信的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just talking out loud. That's not a part of the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.42,0:50:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是揉成团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wad that up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.30,0:50:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许可以试一试说出你的心里话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if you try speaking from the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.81,0:50:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的阿特拉斯之女\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dear daughters of Atlas,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.68,0:50:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴力不是解决问题的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}violence is not the answer."
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.96,0:51:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 如果说实话 我可以饶你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Child, I will spare your life if you're honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.34,0:51:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.80,0:51:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 选这个话题 还真是够讽刺的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, wow, very, um, ironic subject choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.38,0:51:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的继承者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other Champions…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.80,0:51:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也是像你一样的孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are they children like yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.14,0:51:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,具体什么样才算是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What even is a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.93,0:51:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概每星期都会刮胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I know I shave, like, every week-ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.98,0:51:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是或不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.44,0:51:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 答案是否定的 因为没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Your answer is no because nobody's stupid enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.27,0:51:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,会愚蠢到把上古神力给一群小屁孩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}to grant primordial god-like powers to a bunch of kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.36,0:51:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us their names.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.53,0:51:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,继承者的名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The names of the Champions?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.49,0:51:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有布雷特布雷耶 还有伯克布雷耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, well, there's Brett Breyer, and, uh, Burke Breyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.95,0:51:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这样能记住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you guys taking this stuff in?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.37,0:51:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,写下来 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Writing this down? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.45,0:51:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们开一辆皮卡 - 他在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They drive a Dodge Ram. - He's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.37,0:52:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的超能力 不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your superpower, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.79,0:52:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说有个控制狂姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she thinks you're a total control freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.96,0:52:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一个 可能是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of you. Probably you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.34,0:52:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,按住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.51,0:52:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.93,0:52:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 什么东西 她要 她要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening? What is that? What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.10,0:52:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心混沌之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power of chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.26,0:52:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会侵入并且摧毁你的意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}It enters a man's mind and shatters it whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.81,0:52:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脑子乱七八糟的 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. My mind is already trash,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.31,0:52:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有本事你就试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'd actually like to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.06,0:52:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为没有人有胆量去应付我脑子里面的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because nobody has the balls to handle what's inside my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.11,0:52:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出他们的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say their names.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.20,0:52:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出他们的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say their names.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.91,0:52:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出他们的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say their names.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.37,0:52:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,天命真女组合比你强多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny's Child did it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.63,0:52:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他比看起来要更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is stronger than he looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.43,0:52:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说出他们的名字 - 停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say their names. - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.76,0:52:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,比 比比比 比比比 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.22,0:53:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴巴 比 比利巴巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy Bats…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.73,0:53:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴特 比利巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy B…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.40,0:53:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.45,0:53:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是继承者们来的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is from the Champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.45,0:53:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,“亲爱的阿特拉斯之女\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dear daughters of Atlas,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.28,0:53:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴力不是解决问题的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}violence is not the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.79,0:53:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这个开场白真不错 谢谢你 达拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good first sentence. Thanks, Darla.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.46,0:53:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们希望做一笔交易” - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'd like to make a trade. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.33,0:53:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,“我们愿意放弃超能力 以此换回弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll give up our powers if you give us Freddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.59,0:53:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上毫发无损\N{\fnArial\fs30}add "unharmed".
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.17,0:53:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得让她们耍些小聪明 钻了空子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, they're gonna monkey's-paw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.17,0:53:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真聪明 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.68,0:53:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫 加上毫发无损\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve, add "unharmed".
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.22,0:53:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后写上此致敬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, like, "yours, trul…"
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.35,0:53:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 换成敬上 祝好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, "Sincerely, best".
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.18,0:53:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,干脆署名就写继承者们好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe just signed "The Champions".
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.23,0:53:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要校对一遍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we proofread it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.98,0:53:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naw,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.98,0:53:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫不会犯错的 它总是如实记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve doesn't make mistakes, just writes what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.69,0:53:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 我感觉写得相当不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. I feel good about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.07,0:53:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.20,0:53:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有谁还想来一瓶电解质水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else want a Gatorade?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.20,0:53:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有红瓶的吗 ”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have red?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.70,0:54:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,电解质水是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this Gatorade?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.75,0:54:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.79,0:54:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.83,0:54:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要再折磨他了吧 信你听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need not torture him any longer. You heard the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.38,0:54:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丢进深渊里 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Throw them in the pit. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.22,0:54:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是想做笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want to make a trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.26,0:54:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会赴约的 妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will meet, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.05,0:54:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是人类并不值得信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}But humans are not to be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.22,0:54:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,深渊只是名字可怕 其实很有趣 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pit is just a bad name for a fun place, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.52,0:54:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.58,0:54:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.12,0:54:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 感觉像个废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.63,0:54:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是你得站起来 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you must get up. - For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.42,0:54:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我假装是超级英雄 只不过是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this pretending to be a superhero is just…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.13,0:54:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了掩饰崩溃的内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}a way for me to pretend I'm not broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.01,0:55:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,百感交集\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.49,0:55:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有个东西在动 - 对 我也看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I see something moving. - Yeah, I see it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.80,0:55:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.34,0:55:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.55,0:55:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉冬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.84,0:55:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯花园的守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guardian of the Garden of Atlas.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.94,0:55:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.98,0:55:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.13,0:56:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫 别叫 没事 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay! You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.79,0:56:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉可不像没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel okay at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.13,0:56:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那便是那条巨龙的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the power of the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.51,0:56:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它每个毛孔都散发着令人胆寒的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It emanates fear from every pore of its body.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.30,0:56:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉冬的恐怖能麻痹任何凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladon's fear paralyzes any mortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.68,0:56:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就没人能靠近它守护的花园了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that none can approach the garden it protects.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.97,0:56:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个轴心之力 真酷 非常非常特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power of axis. Very cool, very, very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.60,0:56:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,安西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthea!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.81,0:56:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.48,0:56:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,通往你们世界的大门就在迷宫的中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door back to your world is at the center of the labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.48,0:56:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,右转 左转 左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, left, left.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.98,0:56:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,再沿右侧墙壁走到中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then follow the right-hand wall to the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.86,0:56:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能用得上 - 你怎么找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll need this. - How did you find this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.78,0:56:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾在你的世界保护我不被欺负\N{\fnArial\fs30}You once protected me from the bullies in your world,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.12,0:56:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪弗里曼 在这儿换我保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy Freeman. Now I've protected you in mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.83,0:56:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.17,0:56:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一说一 其实我并不需要你的保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, to be fair, I didn't actually need your protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.42,0:56:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你插手前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to rearrange those boys'
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.46,0:57:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要把他们的五脏六腑颠倒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}internal organs when you stepped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.67,0:57:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你并不知情 所以你确实非常勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't know that, which does make you brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.80,0:57:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我勇敢是因为知道自己有超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just brave because I knew I had powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.35,0:57:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你最强大的力量其实是你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the most powerful thing about you is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.77,0:57:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩真是太有爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How lovely for both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.56,0:57:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,女神 真的万分感谢 可是我们必须得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddess, we thank you much, but we must get…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.77,0:57:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们走吧 姐姐们不需要你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go. My sisters don't need you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.78,0:57:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们现在只想要种籽\N{\fnArial\fs30}All they require now is the seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.99,0:57:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 你说种籽 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The seed? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.41,0:57:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,种籽依然藏在她们神族无法触及的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which remains hidden in a place unreachable by any of their kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.20,0:57:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 杰夫 快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, come, Jeff. Faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.45,0:57:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我杰夫 她刚刚说了我的全名\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call me Jeff? She just said my entire name!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.62,0:57:37.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨姆城堡牛肉三明治）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.05,0:57:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 嗨 神 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, God… No?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.10,0:57:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟 低压老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Low Voltage.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.02,0:57:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候能弄走这个破穹顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you fixing this dome shit, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.94,0:57:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别担心 先生 我有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no, don't worry, sir. I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.94,0:58:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.23,0:58:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你看起来只有三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause look like all you got is a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.24,0:58:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些三明治吗 不 它们真的很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, these sandwiches? No, these sandwiches are important.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.40,0:58:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些都是谈事用的 - 才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're, they're for a meeting. - Yeah, sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.20,0:58:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,三明治上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Cheesesteak.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.16,0:58:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.33,0:58:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖 得好好起个名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy, I really need a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.08,0:58:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走路没声音啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet one, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.92,0:58:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能让我神不知鬼不觉地割开敌人的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find it the most effective way to slit an enemy's throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.42,0:58:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真 那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.59,0:58:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是认真的 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're totally serious. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.10,0:58:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 事情是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, so, look, here's the thing, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.51,0:58:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很生气 一群巫师偷走了你们的神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're upset. A bunch of wizards came and stole your powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.98,0:58:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事糟糕透顶 我完全理解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}which totally sucks balls, I totally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.39,0:58:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.56,0:58:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你们把这件事情上升到私人恩怨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of feel like you're taking this all, like, really personally and,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.07,0:58:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 我们根本不认识吧 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, I don't even know you, lady, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.53,0:58:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果小偷半夜冲进你家\N{\fnArial\fs30}If thieves stormed your home in the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.90,0:58:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷走了你所有的硬币逃之夭夭\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stole all your coin and then fled,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.07,0:58:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你理所应当会追上去 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would naturally give chase, would you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.70,0:58:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设在追捕的过程中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And say, in this pursuit the thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.45,0:58:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,小偷把钱掉到了地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}dropped the money on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.75,0:58:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果你的邻居捡到 并且据为己有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your neighbor picked it up and kept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.62,0:59:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面 想象一下你丢的不是钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, imagine it is not money,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.63,0:59:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是你父亲的命脉根基\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the lifeblood of your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.80,0:59:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你母亲的最后一口呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last breath of your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.96,0:59:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一位神身上的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power of all the gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.34,0:59:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及神界上上下下的魔法都被人偷走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the magic of the entire realm that was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.72,0:59:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在 这股魔法在你的身上流淌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now this magic courses through you,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.60,0:59:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个人竟然恬不知耻地认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you have the gall.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.06,0:59:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你应得的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}to believe that you deserve it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.65,0:59:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事绝对是私人恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is very personal,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.48,0:59:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.28,0:59:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很有震慑力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are very menacing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.49,0:59:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你知道这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to know that. Like, I really…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.70,0:59:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的气场实在太强大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the presence that you have,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.58,0:59:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能很大程度上就是因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that goes a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.54,0:59:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是今天我到这里来主要是想谈谈妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}But today, I really wanted to talk about compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.17,0:59:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妥协绝对不可能 - 妥协绝对不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There is no compromise. - There is no compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.75,0:59:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你一定会那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you were gonna say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.96,0:59:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼的智慧 别耍花招 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wisdom of Saruman. Don't mess with me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.59,0:59:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出弗莱迪 然后再把这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us back Freddy, you take down this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.80,0:59:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,罩在天上的圆圆的魔法大碗弄走\N{\fnArial\fs30}sphere-y dome-y magic bowl thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.22,0:59:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样一来 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.60,0:59:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不用把你们都消灭掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we won't have to annihilate you into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.14,0:59:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这提议不错 我没开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good offer. I'm being serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.98,0:59:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很想扮演一个男子汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You play the part of a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.73,1:00:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是演技却很拙劣\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you do not play it well.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.11,1:00:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把超能力还给我们 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us the powers, child.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.15,1:00:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.94,1:00:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 你不是个领导者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are no leader, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.65,1:00:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是个迷茫的小男孩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a lost boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.86,1:00:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,却总是喜欢假装自己是个勇士\N{\fnArial\fs30}who likes to make-believe that he's a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.08,1:00:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着 也许我没你阅历丰富\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look. I might not have as much experience as you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.70,1:00:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为毕竟我不像你这么一把年纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm not, like, super old like you,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.62,1:00:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我想我也有一些你没有过的经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think I have a few experiences that you don't have.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.63,1:00:25.38,Title,0,0,0,0,,女士 我看过所有《速度与激情》电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I've seen all of the Fast and the Furious movies, lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.96,1:00:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么跟你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.63,1:00:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的永远是家人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all about family!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.01,1:00:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人们 伙计们 那是信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family! Guys, that was the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.02,1:00:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们差不多练过十二次 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We practiced this, like, 12 times. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.60,1:00:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是忘记了我的家人们 女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgot all about my family, didn't you, Goddess?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.86,1:00:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 人类 是你忘记了我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, human. You forgot about mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.70,1:01:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来呀 - 快走 - 佩德罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Let's go. - Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.74,1:01:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在浪费我的时间 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting my time, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.53,1:02:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.24,1:02:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定没预见有这招\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sure didn't see that coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.95,1:02:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她根本没有去看眼科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}because she didn't go to the eye doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.83,1:02:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,达拉 那是因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Darla, that was, 'cause…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.58,1:02:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那叫委婉语 是委婉的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}A euphemism. That was a euphemism.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.14,1:02:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.69,1:02:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经夺回了你两位家人的超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've taken the power from two in your family already.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.24,1:02:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又有两个要没命了 是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now two more must die, and for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.78,1:03:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你能继续玩打仗游戏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can keep playing soldier?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.57,1:03:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲是阿特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was Atlas.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.11,1:03:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是掌管毅力和力量的泰坦巨神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Titan god of stamina and strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.58,1:03:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他的魔法和神力在你的身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}His magic and power may course through you,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.33,1:03:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你永远都成为不了一个真正的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you will never be a true god.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.75,1:03:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那他会快速移动吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? Did your dad have superspeed?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.63,1:03:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.81,1:04:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事吧 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.06,1:04:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好玩儿 快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was fun. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.77,1:04:10.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（营业中 每周日 上午9：00-下午4：00）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.06,1:04:11.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（厕王有限责任公司）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.02,1:04:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿 快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.07,1:04:16.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（员工通道）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.94,1:04:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快点儿 快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, everyone! Let's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.87,1:04:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.63,1:04:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought you were just goin'
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.63,1:04:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要挤进一个移动厕所里 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}into some regular porta-potty, didn't ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.55,1:04:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在好像还能闻到一点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which I can somehow still smell.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.76,1:04:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 没错 那个味散不去 真要命 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, yeah, it really sticks around. It's crazy, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.47,1:04:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像渗到了空气里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, permeates the air.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.18,1:04:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓了 总之欢迎来到永恒之岩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter. Anyway, welcome to the Rock of Eternity.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.05,1:04:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有继承者们才可以通过任意一扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only Champions can get in here, through any door.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.14,1:04:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we want.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.14,1:04:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们几个能做到 你的妹妹们不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little thing that we can do that your sisters can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.69,1:04:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 这个就是我说的大获全胜 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, that's what I call a total success. Okay,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.73,1:04:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少也算小有成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe, like, a partial total win.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.78,1:04:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了我躲避球很烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you I suck at dodgeball.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.19,1:05:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 确实如此 可是 听着 佩德罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you do, yeah, but you know, look, Pedro,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.86,1:05:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每个人都有弱点 懂我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we all have our weak spots. You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.78,1:05:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hers…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.66,1:05:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是缺乏战略思维\N{\fnArial\fs30}lack of strategic thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.41,1:05:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,该说正事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now for the real trade.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.20,1:05:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪 还有神杖 换你的自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy and the staff, for your freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.62,1:05:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得把穹顶撤掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get rid of the dome.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.21,1:05:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 把穹顶撤掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. And get rid of the dome.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.46,1:05:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这座友爱之城变得有点潮乎乎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause the city of brotherly love is gettin' a little moist.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.72,1:05:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真会用词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word choice, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.72,1:05:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 我一说出这个词马上就后悔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I regretted it as soon as it was coming out of my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.22,1:05:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么说太…就只有那一个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just one of those words…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.47,1:05:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I just…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.35,1:05:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,“亲爱的阿特傻瓜拉斯的女儿们” 真伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dear daughters of Asshat-Las." Burn!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.02,1:05:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我灵光一现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just came up with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.98,1:05:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得加上一个破折号 这样才更明显 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you put a dash in there, though, so it's really clear. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.70,1:05:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 有史蒂夫检查语法和拼写真的太方便了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, it's so good having Steve cover grammar.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.03,1:05:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听起来像个大聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}and spelling and stuff, it makes me sound so much smarter.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.70,1:05:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.83,1:05:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,“用兄弟换姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A brother for a sister, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.29,1:05:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.83,1:05:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 你们怎么会是亲姐妹呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, how are you actually sisters,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.67,1:05:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们的年龄差距\N{\fnArial\fs30}because the age difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.38,1:05:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在过于明显 而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}is very noticeable, and.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.13,1:06:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点令人不安 实话实说”\N{\fnArial\fs30}slightly upsetting, I'm not gonna lie."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.55,1:06:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然说我不是特别喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though I don't like you very much,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.05,1:06:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且每个人都该享有人权\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe everyone deserves human rights,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.01,1:06:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你不配吃草莓味的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you don't deserve strawberry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.85,1:06:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能吃黄色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only get yellow.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.06,1:06:14.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（基地）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.31,1:06:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.73,1:06:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.99,1:06:27.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（冷静区）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.91,1:06:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就觉得我们抓她太容易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we brought her in too easily.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.62,1:06:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是故意被抓的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted to get caught.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.62,1:06:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太明白 她能跑哪儿去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it. Where would she even go?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.22,1:06:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏了 其实早该料到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this seemed inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.06,1:06:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们彻底迷路了 谢了 笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. We are so lost. Thanks, bozo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.02,1:06:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并没有迷路 到底谁是巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not lost. Who's the wizard here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.19,1:07:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 这个我可说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.65,1:07:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你既不会咒语 也没有什么法器\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have any spells, no magical artifacts,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.28,1:07:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对魔法一无所知 就只会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know nothing about magic, you're just…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.82,1:07:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是巫师 - 谢谢 - 随便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're the wizard. - Thank you. - Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.45,1:07:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在让我们看看你女朋友是否可以信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's see if that girlfriend of yours can be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.64,1:07:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back, get back. Get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.61,1:07:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.79,1:08:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 应该安全了 我们回家 - 等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, I think the coast is clear. Let's go home. - One moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.38,1:08:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看到她手里拿着什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you not see what she was holding?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.17,1:08:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,苹果而已 说不定她想吃水果 那有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an apple. She wanted a snack. What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.01,1:08:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个就是金苹果 生命之树上结的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The golden apple. From the Tree of Life.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.06,1:08:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命之树\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the Tree of Life.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.56,1:08:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 它不是在安全的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait, hold up, didn't you say that was somewhere safe?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.60,1:08:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比利 - 比利 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Billy! - Billy. Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.82,1:08:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going now?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.32,1:08:28.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（没有氧气 仅限成人）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.95,1:08:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.04,1:08:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.29,1:08:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.25,1:08:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a hard pass. That's a hard pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.25,1:08:42.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危险 请勿入内）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.21,1:08:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 不用管那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Billy, you don't gotta worry about that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.84,1:08:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面是一个哪儿都去不了的迷宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a labyrinth that doesn't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.59,1:08:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像古希腊的迷宫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like an ancient Greek labyrinth?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.46,1:08:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.80,1:08:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,厕所味\N{\fnArial\fs30}porta-potty.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.23,1:09:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫斯佩拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hespera.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.90,1:09:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over, sisters.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.45,1:09:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们可以种下种籽 重建神界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we can plant the seed and restore our realm.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.41,1:09:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者种在他们那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we plant it in their realm.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.20,1:09:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会毁了他们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that would destroy their world.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.08,1:09:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是以牙还牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as they destroyed ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.46,1:09:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在说笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.50,1:09:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.50,1:09:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我们不是这么约定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, that's not what we agreed to.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.22,1:09:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 安西娅 你这小傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthea, you simpering bore.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.68,1:09:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得对 这一刻我们等太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right, we've spent ages waiting for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.01,1:09:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿到了种籽 还有神杖和它的魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the seed. We have the staff and its powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.31,1:09:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能为你的私欲而浪费这次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not squandering it for your personal satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.52,1:09:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 不行 应该我去 你别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I should go, not you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.77,1:09:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.11,1:09:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拄拐的孩子不是做贼的好材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid with the crutch doesn't exactly sing "sneak thief."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.07,1:09:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.44,1:09:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走路膝盖嘎嘣响 真可怜 你听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your knees crack like crazy when you walk. It's pathetic. See?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.95,1:09:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 弗莱迪 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortune be with you, Freddy. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.74,1:09:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚叫我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you just call me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.33,1:10:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.08,1:10:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪弗里曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy Freeman.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.46,1:10:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 叫对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. You nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.71,1:10:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在另一边会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.80,1:10:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we did,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.76,1:10:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命之树也无法在人界土壤中生长\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Tree of Life would not thrive in their soil.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.01,1:10:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会搞破坏 会生出面目全非的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would despoil, it would disfigure into something…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.18,1:10:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物 人类都是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monstrous? That is what humans are.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.01,1:10:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们的怪物带到他们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is only fitting that we bring our monsters to their world.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.18,1:10:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,以牙还牙 才是正确的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do to them as they did to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.65,1:10:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好要恢复双方的平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We agreed to restore balance.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.23,1:10:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,报复会对平衡造成很大影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}and vengeance has great measure of weight on those scales.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.49,1:10:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,安西娅 人类都很凶残 对同类也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthea, humans are villains, even to themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.62,1:10:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不全是 - 全是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, not all. - All.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.95,1:10:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,妹妹 我认为你被愤怒冲昏了头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister, I fear your rage has gotten the better of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.16,1:10:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.12,1:10:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类肆意破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans wreak havoc and devastation,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.54,1:10:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又祈求神灵赦免\N{\fnArial\fs30}then pray to the gods to absolve them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.92,1:10:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们祈求秩序与和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}They actually pray for order and peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.55,1:10:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,却每次都会毁掉这两样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}when all they do is dismantle it at every turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.51,1:10:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,安西娅 你现在拿着苹果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthea, I want you to take the apple.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.09,1:10:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,种到我们的花园里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and plant it in our garden.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.18,1:11:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你果然向着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you turn to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.68,1:11:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲一定会以你们为耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father would be ashamed of both of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.44,1:11:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西是哪儿来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did that even come from?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.56,1:11:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.48,1:11:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你向着她 赫斯佩拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You favor her, Hespera,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.82,1:11:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果她背叛了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see how she betrays us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.24,1:11:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 送他上西天 姐姐 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Deliver him to his proper fate, sister. - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.95,1:11:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.33,1:11:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.37,1:11:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great question. No idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.29,1:11:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是骗到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But made you look.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.38,1:11:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.38,1:11:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的拐杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your crutch!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.43,1:11:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shazam!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.14,1:11:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 休想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.31,1:11:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多话要聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we have a lot to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.28,1:11:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡吕普索 把神杖给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kalypso, hand me the staff.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.41,1:12:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没资格用它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not fit to wield it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.16,1:12:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你有资格 你拿着它毫无作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}More fit than you. You had him in your hands, yet did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.29,1:12:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们唯一的目的是为父亲报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our sole purpose is to avenge our father,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.75,1:12:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果每个人都软弱不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}but everyone here has become weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.92,1:12:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉冬 灭世者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladon, world-eater,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.84,1:12:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快觉醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}rise from the pit!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.31,1:12:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 全能大队长 他要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go, go, go! - Captain Everypower! Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.98,1:12:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.45,1:12:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,维克多 维克多 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor? Victor, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.66,1:12:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这女人 怎么了 - 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. Oh, God, woman. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.79,1:12:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 赶紧走 赶紧离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad. We gotta go! We gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.04,1:12:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿 快起床 对 现在就得走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.63,1:12:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可笑是吗 我知道你们怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is funny, right? I know what this looks like.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.92,1:13:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 我也不知道你们怎么看 你们别慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true. I have no idea what this looks like. Just don't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.59,1:13:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们来干什么 - 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.47,1:13:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别怕 - 我是玛丽 - 不 不 你们可千万别慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't be afraid. - I'm Mary. - No, no, no, you guys, don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.43,1:13:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 听我们解释 这是我们的另一种形态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down and listen to us explain. This is another form of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.35,1:13:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你们别慌 看着我 我是比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said don't freak out! Look at me, it's Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.06,1:13:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗莎 我是比利 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosa, it's Billy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.44,1:13:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是尤金和弗莱迪 那是达拉和玛丽 - 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that's Eugene, and that's Freddy… - It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.85,1:13:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 还有佩德罗 正常的佩德罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Darla and that's Mary, obvi, and then Pedro, just normal Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.03,1:13:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 没时间隐瞒了好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, this is no time for secrets, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.15,1:13:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得告诉他们真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to tell 'em the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.94,1:13:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我 我们是超级英雄 - 我出柜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're superheroes. - I'm gay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.28,1:13:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we know, bud.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.16,1:13:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You knew? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.87,1:13:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.83,1:13:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the wizard.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.96,1:13:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是巫师 他是人称巫师的巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is the wizard. He's a wizard who's called "the wizard."
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.58,1:13:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 快穿衣服 快 快 快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, get dressed right now. Come on, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.13,1:13:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿好衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put on these clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.38,1:13:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,太离谱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is so weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.80,1:13:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 对 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.09,1:13:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就是费城的废柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are the Philly Fiascoes?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.84,1:13:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不会承认那个愚蠢的绰号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. This is in no way an acknowledgement of that stupid nickname.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.22,1:13:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 确实是我们 你们能快点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, yes, that would be us. Now can you pick up the pace?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.31,1:13:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了 巨龙要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go. The dragon is here!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.89,1:13:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.51,1:14:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧 没事 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.23,1:14:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道信息量有点大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this is a lot to take in,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.02,1:14:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我保证稍后会解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I promise to explain it all later.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.23,1:14:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,解释什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explain what?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.15,1:14:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们是超级英雄 被众神追杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That our kids are superheroes being hunted by Greek gods…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.32,1:14:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她们用龙毁了我们买的新房 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that used a dragon to destroy the house we just bought? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.24,1:14:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 你们买房了 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, you bought the house? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.95,1:14:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.21,1:15:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.76,1:15:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.72,1:15:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.60,1:15:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.52,1:15:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.81,1:15:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 是想要它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey! This is what you want, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.08,1:15:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we're good.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.46,1:15:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在安全了 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're safe right now. Let's go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.82,1:16:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.69,1:16:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.73,1:16:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.57,1:16:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.12,1:16:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.95,1:16:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨龙跑哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where is this dragon?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.79,1:16:59.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（费城人队 市民银行球场）
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.15,1:17:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里适合做花园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fitting place for a garden.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.12,1:18:24.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（树篱路 春园街）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.30,1:18:33.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（春园街）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.42,1:19:12.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（市中心 费城交响乐团 议会大厦）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.55,1:19:14.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（费城州立博物馆 会展中心区）
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.77,1:20:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 我要掉下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, I'm slipping! Slipping!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.86,1:20:20.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（费城警察）
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.05,1:20:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy moly.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.03,1:20:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没想到自己会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I never thought I'd say this about a dragon,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.44,1:21:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但巨龙现在只能算小麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it is the least of our problems right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.45,1:21:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们的世界要完了 - 这不明摆着吗 神棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your world will not survive this. - Yeah, no shit, Merlin!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.25,1:21:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.41,1:21:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.79,1:21:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 没受伤吧 - 我没事 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? Are you hurt? - I'm okay, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.79,1:21:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在神界 这棵树\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the God Realm, this tree…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.30,1:21:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,代表着美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a thing of beauty.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.80,1:21:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.51,1:21:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不适合在人界生长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not meant for the soil of this realm.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.01,1:21:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,借播种人之手变成了怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's become monstrous by the hand that planted it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.22,1:21:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她到底是哪一头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose side is she on, anyway? Do you…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.22,1:21:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去说服赫斯佩拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must try to sway Hespera.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.48,1:21:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有她能阻止卡吕普索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only she can subdue our sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.56,1:21:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会全力以赴 殊死一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give it my all, or die trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.61,1:21:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,死 不行 我想一定能有办法让你不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die? No, I'm pretty sure we can come up with an alternative to dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.82,1:21:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪宝贝儿 我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sweet Freddy, I'm ready if need be.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.49,1:21:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我年纪很大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lived a long life.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.65,1:21:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫年纪很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about, "Lived a long life?"
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.91,1:21:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们同龄 你我都很年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the same age. You're young. We're young.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.28,1:21:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经六千多岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm over 6, 000 years old.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.58,1:21:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真会保养\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look great.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.38,1:21:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好像不该在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suddenly seems inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.42,1:22:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.06,1:22:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让她死 她叫我宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let her die. She called me sweet!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.39,1:22:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得想想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.48,1:22:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收回我的力量 - 不行 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take my powers back. - No, Billy!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.44,1:22:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 嘿 收回我的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Hey, take my powers back.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.15,1:22:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你既然能给我 也肯定能收回\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave 'em to me, so you can take 'em back, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.82,1:22:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不是继承者了 你才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am no longer the champion. You are!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.28,1:22:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我能解决问题 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I know how to fix this, dude,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.49,1:22:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我真的不会 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I really don't, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.91,1:22:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不认识那希腊三姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, I didn't even know who those Greek sisters were.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.99,1:22:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得上网查 但你知道她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to Google them. But you know who they are,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.62,1:22:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也知道该怎么办 你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means you know what to do. And you were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.75,1:22:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选错人了 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picked the wrong champion, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.00,1:22:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才老说同进同退\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's why I always say "all or none, " right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.46,1:22:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我没了家人不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because without my family, I'm nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.26,1:22:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道自己在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And honestly, I have no idea what I'm doin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.72,1:22:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.68,1:22:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脑子里没有一丁点智慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a shred of wisdom in that brain of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.01,1:22:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你有睿智的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your heart is wise.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.72,1:22:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它非常清楚该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it knows exactly what must be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.19,1:22:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用一千年时间寻找够格的继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent millennia searching for a worthy champion.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.48,1:23:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人配得上我曾经与兄弟姐妹分享的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one was worthy of what I once shared with my brothers and sisters.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.03,1:23:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你分享力量的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when you shared your powers,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.20,1:23:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没有犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}you did not hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.83,1:23:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得人人都有资格\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you, everyone can be worthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.12,1:23:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}if given a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.75,1:23:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 去为家人而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, go fight for your family.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.00,1:23:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为世界而战吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go fight for the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.21,1:23:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当年没有选错人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose right when I chose you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.84,1:23:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 比利 我们该怎么做 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy? Billy, what are we gonna do, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.01,1:23:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,按老办法来 弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same thing we always do, Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.93,1:23:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救该死的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the God darn world.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.81,1:23:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在去抢神杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm gonna go get that staff.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.22,1:23:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们趁我对付巨龙的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I need you to lure these things away.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.27,1:23:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,引怪物离开体育场 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the stadium while I deal with the dragon, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.98,1:23:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, Billy, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.81,1:23:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我看看你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I just see you, before you go?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.32,1:23:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这个你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this version.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.15,1:23:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真正的你 我的比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… You. My Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.66,1:23:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shazam!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.50,1:23:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是房子老被闪电劈的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why the house keeps getting struck by lightning?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.30,1:24:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证如果最后我没被龙吃掉的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise after this if I don't get eaten by a dragon,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.81,1:24:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会强迫你留下我 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna force you to keep me. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.02,1:24:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我知道我快到年龄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I know I age out soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.77,1:24:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.78,1:24:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出色 善良 勇敢的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wonderful, kind, brave, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.03,1:24:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远是我们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never age out of your home.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.45,1:24:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.96,1:24:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,先帮我做件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.04,1:24:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我发自内心的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I mean this from the bottom of my heart,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.71,1:24:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,去打败她们 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}go kick their ass, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.26,1:24:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.97,1:24:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.93,1:24:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shazam!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.19,1:25:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还真得适应一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gonna take some getting used to.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.60,1:25:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快上战车 走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody to the battle wagon!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.65,1:25:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,战车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The battle wagon?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.36,1:25:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想凑个热闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to get into the spirit of things.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.20,1:25:15.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（市民银行球场）
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.46,1:25:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看你对这些人做了什么 - 看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you see what you're doing to these people? - I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.97,1:25:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们咎由自取\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what I see is just.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.68,1:25:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫斯佩拉 你看这棵树\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hespera, look at this tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.43,1:25:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它枯萎了 这里不适合它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is blighted. It is unnatural here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.72,1:25:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发誓要重建神界 而不是毁掉人界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made a vow to restore our realm, not destroy another.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.02,1:25:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,神终于回应了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}A god has answered their prayers at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.56,1:25:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没摆正自己的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did not know their place,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.69,1:25:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就提点了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I am showing it to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.36,1:25:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的语气像哈迪斯叔叔一样狂妄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fanatical tone echoes our uncle Hades.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.90,1:25:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我要阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm putting an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.87,1:26:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫斯佩拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hespera.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.92,1:26:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.09,1:26:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫斯佩拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hespera.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.80,1:26:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你这么同情人类 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your emotions rest with the humans so, Anne,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.59,1:26:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,安 也许你应该做个人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}then perhaps you should be human.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.95,1:27:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 救命 救救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help, somebody! Somebody help! Somebody help!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.46,1:27:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办 牛头怪太多了 根本撞不完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now what? There are only so many minotaurs I can run over with this van.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.68,1:27:36.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（弗莱迪弗里曼）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.05,1:27:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Steve.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.51,1:27:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物害怕什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are monsters afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.18,1:27:45.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（万兽之王）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.73,1:27:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,万兽之王 是狮子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The king of beasts." Lions?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.27,1:27:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,独角兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unicorns.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.23,1:27:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 我喜欢独角兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I love unicorns.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.44,1:27:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但独角兽不喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet, the unicorn does not love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.44,1:27:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位 独角兽不存在 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys, unicorns don't exist. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.91,1:28:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.04,1:28:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 也许你说得有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess maybe it's not so crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.62,1:28:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,独角兽是兽界最可怕的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The unicorn is the most fearsome creature of its realm.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.96,1:28:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷酷无情 和你故事书上的小马不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruthless and cruel, not like the ponies from your storybooks.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.04,1:28:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们厌恶人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}They loathe humanity.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.42,1:28:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们喜欢什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything they do like?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.09,1:28:14.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（万兽之王）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.34,1:28:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,“黑暗洞穴 仙果”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dark caverns. Ambrosia"?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.59,1:28:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,仙果 那是神吃的甘露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambrosia. It's like the nectar of the gods.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.26,1:28:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该很甜 像蜂蜜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's supposed to be sweet, like honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.89,1:28:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有主意了 走吧 - 等等 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have an idea. Go, go! - Quick, quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.89,1:28:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 你们尽量去多救一些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, get as many of these people to safety as you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.81,1:28:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.56,1:28:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走 快点儿 弗莱迪 - 快 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.65,1:28:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢 - 我跟他们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wizard? - I'm going with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.86,1:28:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.32,1:28:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.79,1:28:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne! Anne!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.87,1:28:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快不知道该怎么当家长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not entirely sure how to parent, here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.55,1:29:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 骑龙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Khaleesi!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.15,1:29:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在太满意了 你感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! That was really satisfying. How was that for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.80,1:29:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.59,1:29:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们爱你 霹雳咔嚓侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}We love you, Thundercrack.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.59,1:29:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最棒了 惊奇队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best, Captain Marvel.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.30,1:29:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 加油 高压老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, go, High Voltage!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.68,1:29:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wassup, bro?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.18,1:29:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是最大电压\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Maximum Voltage actually,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.39,1:29:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我外号很多 我们还在讨论呢 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}amongst other names. We're still kinda workshopping it, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.15,1:29:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为自己刀枪不入 你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought you were invulnerable. But, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.28,1:30:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法火焰 魔法可以杀死魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magical fire. Magic can kill magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.95,1:30:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对对对对 魔法杀死魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah, "Magic kills magic."
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.74,1:30:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,早想到了 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way ahead of you, lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.91,1:30:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是着急 因为衣服头一次烧成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trippin' out because I've never seen my suit burn like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.62,1:30:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 别想在我的城里撒野\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, nobody messes with my town!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.46,1:30:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.71,1:30:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打败了叛徒姐姐 一个神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I defeated my traitor sister. A god.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.75,1:30:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我灭不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I won't destroy you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.93,1:31:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,神杖在吸收能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The staff is absorbing it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.43,1:31:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,像电池一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a battery.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.77,1:31:13.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（卡特里托斯椒盐卷饼）
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.60,1:31:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.48,1:31:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.48,1:31:19.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（单行道 停车）
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.40,1:31:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个馊主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a terrible idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.40,1:31:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道它们有多残暴 多野蛮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand the savagery, the barbarity.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.45,1:31:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.69,1:31:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.60,1:31:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.98,1:32:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.24,1:32:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,达拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darla…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.28,1:32:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 乖乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.92,1:32:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.46,1:32:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,达拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darla!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.28,1:32:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝彩虹糖吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taste the rainbow.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.11,1:32:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.49,1:32:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是眼下最像仙果的东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the closest to ambrosia we have.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.43,1:33:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.70,1:33:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,彩虹糖还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need more Skittles.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.16,1:34:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝彩虹糖 混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taste the rainbow, motherfu…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.51,1:34:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 女士 你不能死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Lady, lady, you can't die!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.56,1:34:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿 比利 快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Billy, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.68,1:34:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,能量 医疗能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powers, powers, powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.64,1:34:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,医疗能量 不 让人起死回生的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical powers. No. How-to-fix-dead-people powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.57,1:34:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,除颤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.91,1:34:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有戏 再来 除颤 - 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! Come on! One more time. Clear! - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.58,1:35:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 让我安心去冥界吧 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Let me go to the Underworld in peace, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.58,1:35:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 听我说 听我说好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, lady, lady, listen to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.08,1:35:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让任何人死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want anyone else to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.25,1:35:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人 安西娅 其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my family, not Anthea, not anyone,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.00,1:35:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以救他们 都因为那棵树 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we can save them. This all came from the tree, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.80,1:35:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准我能想办法连龙带树一起弄死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might know a way to destroy the tree and the dragon all in one.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.97,1:35:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉冬的力量太强了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladon's powers are too great, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.26,1:35:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如果我用大量闪电让神杖过载呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not if I can overload the staff with enough lightning.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.64,1:35:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bomb?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.60,1:35:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样杀得死巨龙吗 - 不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that enough to kill the dragon? - And more.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.69,1:35:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把穹顶内部炸成平地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would annihilate everything that's inside the dome.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.90,1:35:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我还得求你一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I have one more favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.50,1:35:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne! Anne!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.01,1:35:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.45,1:36:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.29,1:36:26.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（费城特警）
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.87,1:36:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back away!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.68,1:36:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.30,1:36:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉冬 杀掉叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladon, kill the traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.09,1:37:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.68,1:37:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他屈服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bow him!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.77,1:37:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不行了 弗莱迪 没有神力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost it. Freddy, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.48,1:37:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去力量的神还是神吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is a god without her power?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.36,1:37:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上最强大的力量其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most powerful thing about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.41,1:37:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}is you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.74,1:37:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taught me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.29,1:37:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.77,1:38:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,砰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.60,1:38:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙啊龙 你肯定失望透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must be super disappointing as a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.78,1:38:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你是条龙 你会飞 会喷火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assuming that you are one. I mean, you fly, and you breathe fire,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.90,1:38:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,身子却是木头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're also made of wood which is a weird flex.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.03,1:38:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是严重的设计缺陷 没什么好吹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a serious design flaw, if I'm being honest.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.62,1:38:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪 安西娅 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy, Anthea, don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.04,1:38:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, made you look!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.37,1:38:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 又上当了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, lady, that's twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.71,1:38:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我连着火的小提琴都没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't even need a flaming violin that time.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.67,1:38:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要神杖吗 过来拿呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the staff? Come get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.58,1:39:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 赫斯佩拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Hespera.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.75,1:39:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 赫斯佩拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Hespera.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.26,1:39:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快呀 快呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.44,1:39:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.49,1:40:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.39,1:40:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤掉穹顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove the dome.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.14,1:40:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我还有气\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I still breathe,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.89,1:40:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,穹顶就在\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dome still stands.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.56,1:41:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在另一个世界等着你 妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till I see you on the other side, sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.99,1:41:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.57,1:41:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点儿出来 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of there. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.36,1:41:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.57,1:41:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.24,1:41:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 你在干什么 你不应该在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, what are you doing? You're not supposed to be in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.00,1:42:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.38,1:42:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直觉得自己没用 不配拥有这身力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to think that I couldn't do anything right, that I didn't deserve my powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.71,1:42:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我能做到一件事 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But there's something that I can do. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.47,1:42:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以救你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can save all of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.01,1:42:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们同进同退 - 只能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it's all or none! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.93,1:42:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家人都能活下来 谁也不会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of my family gets to live and none of them gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.48,1:42:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪 我曾经是孤儿 你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy, I've never had a family. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.27,1:42:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在乎过的人都离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody I've ever cared about, they all left me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.73,1:42:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈 我爸爸 所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom, my dad, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.49,1:42:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以有了你们以后 我就得抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when I found you guys, I had to hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.57,1:42:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓得太紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've been hanging on too tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.16,1:42:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.07,1:42:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该让你去追梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have let you do your own thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.33,1:42:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你可以飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's time for you to fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.45,1:42:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.38,1:42:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是全能小队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Captain Everypower Junior.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.71,1:42:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.64,1:43:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个了断吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We end this now.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.77,1:43:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We do.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.91,1:43:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.44,1:44:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能行 你能行 他能行 他能行 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got this. We got this. He's got this. He's got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.57,1:44:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.41,1:44:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.00,1:44:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.26,1:45:01.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（费城人队）
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.76,1:45:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.50,1:46:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shazam!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.10,1:47:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.98,1:47:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位真神 谁能想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}A true god, after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.45,1:48:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.50,1:48:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must go.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.97,1:48:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.56,1:48:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.81,1:48:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.81,1:48:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.31,1:48:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.86,1:48:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.90,1:48:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.87,1:48:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy! Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.58,1:48:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy! Billy!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.83,1:48:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.21,1:49:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 醒醒 你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, wake up. You did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.17,1:49:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你该醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You're supposed to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.05,1:49:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照剧本 你应该醒过来 睁开眼微笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the part where you wake up and open your eyes and laugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.80,1:49:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你上当了 我真上当了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're supposed to say you got me, 'cause you got me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.35,1:49:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 别开玩笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude. Joke's over, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.81,1:49:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.89,1:49:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy. Billy, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.52,1:49:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.07,1:49:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.82,1:49:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.95,1:49:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比利 - 他在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Billy? - He's over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.79,1:49:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.29,1:49:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.42,1:49:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们同进同退 同进同退\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're a team! We're a team!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.42,1:49:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.01,1:49:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.05,1:49:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的宝贝儿 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my baby. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.81,1:49:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.02,1:50:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,既是英雄 也是神\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a hero and a god.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.56,1:50:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该得到妥善安葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he should be laid to rest like one.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.95,1:50:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.64,1:51:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还能复原吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will this land ever come back?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.35,1:51:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,神杖的魔力耗尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The staff is drained of magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.19,1:51:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有神之火花才能修复它的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the spark of a god can restore its power.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.19,1:51:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可神已经走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there are no gods left.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.15,1:51:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.42,1:51:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.62,1:52:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.97,1:53:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a zombie!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.31,1:53:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.02,1:53:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.48,1:53:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两分钟就把我埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You buried me? In what, like, two minutes?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.90,1:53:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Billy!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.07,1:53:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 我好想你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Oh, man. I missed you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.11,1:53:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.45,1:53:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.08,1:53:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 为什么不告诉我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Why didn't anybody tell…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.29,1:53:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 抱歉 我刚才…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Sorry, sorry, I didn't, uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.25,1:53:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看到你 我刚才 刚才…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see you there, I was, um, I was…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.29,1:53:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was dead at the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.38,1:53:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你收到飞鸟传信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you, uh… you got my bird letter?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.22,1:53:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.22,1:54:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这里好像有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you've got something…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.22,1:54:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的…哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my… Where…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.68,1:54:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.73,1:54:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a spider.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.77,1:54:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 这样很恶心 而且也很尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, that's disgusting. Also, that's really embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.82,1:54:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.07,1:54:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你做的事情很了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was an amazing thing you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.61,1:54:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你牺牲了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sacrifice you made.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.61,1:54:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这个世界重焕生机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought this world back to life.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.62,1:54:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这一次 神与人类能和平共处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this time, gods and humans can learn to live in peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.70,1:54:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.87,1:54:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好运用宙斯的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use the power of Zeus wisely.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.13,1:54:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重 比利巴特森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be well, Billy Batson.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.88,1:54:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我身上流淌着你父亲的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know, just because your father's power is surging through me,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.88,1:54:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们没有血缘关系 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that doesn't technically make us related, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.43,1:54:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还差五个月就18岁了 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna be 18 in, like, five months, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.64,1:54:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,专心拯救世界吧 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick to saving the world, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.06,1:54:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那个 那好吧 行 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know, like, that's… Okay, cool. See ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.65,1:54:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家男孩怎么都找老女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with our boys and older women?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.94,1:54:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.15,1:55:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想恢复超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants their powers back?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.49,1:55:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,能恢复吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do that, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.70,1:55:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能 - 好 很好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah. Okay, good. Good, good, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.74,1:55:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想修好房子 - 能修好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd like our house back. - Can we do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.96,1:55:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开饭了 - 来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dinner! - Coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.04,1:55:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们遵守规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw. Thank you for respecting the cross-stitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.05,1:55:18.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（禁止在室内变身）
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.92,1:55:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,安西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthea.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.18,1:55:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想好怎么处理你们神界的事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you decided what you're gonna do about that god realm of yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.14,1:55:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算在神界恢复期间休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually I'm gonna take some time off while it heals.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.85,1:55:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,和人类一起待一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spend some time with the common folk.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.93,1:55:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解你们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learn some about your world,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.35,1:55:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们能不能互相学到东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how, maybe, we can learn from each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.98,1:55:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有智慧的第一标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number one sign of wisdom:
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.73,1:55:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认自己永远有东西要学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admitting there's always more to learn.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.73,1:55:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意识到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming around to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.90,1:55:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.79,1:55:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, guys? Guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.84,1:56:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the wizard.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.84,1:56:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 什么 - 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God! - No way!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.76,1:56:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.68,1:56:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们快看 看看他 多帅 - 天哪 真有范\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at this guy! - Look at him, he's so handsome.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.60,1:56:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真时髦 - 你打扮得太精神了 - 好精神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You pimpin' now, what is this? - You look amazing. - You look great!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.77,1:56:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚好在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was in the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.02,1:56:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,想在走之前过来表达我的感激之情\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, um, I just wanted to express my gratitude before I go.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.36,1:56:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 门铃坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Doorbell's broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.32,1:56:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 家里东西都坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, everything's broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.11,1:56:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.95,1:56:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚好在附近吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just in the neighborhood?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.16,1:56:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我来拿神杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I came for the staff.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.99,1:56:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许会保管它一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I will hold onto it for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.16,1:56:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想在化成一堆灰烬之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also wanted to see your faces one last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.08,1:56:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后见大家一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I turn into a pile of ash.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.92,1:56:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 什么 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, what? - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.21,1:56:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开玩笑的 我叫了优步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am making a joke. I have an Uber waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.51,1:56:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 我在石头堆和监狱里待了太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}And besides… I've been trapped in rocks and prisons for far too long.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.18,1:56:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,该看看你们的世界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to see your world.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.22,1:56:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been an honor,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.93,1:56:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很欣慰 看你们翱翔\N{\fnArial\fs30}a privilege, watching you all soar.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.52,1:56:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这巫师还不赖 - 谢谢 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, you're not such a bad wizard. - Thank you, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.19,1:56:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.52,1:57:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.03,1:57:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的超级英雄叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's my superhero name?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.07,1:57:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呀 叫沙赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name is… Shazam.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.91,1:57:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他记得 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.25,1:57:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有更好的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still think we can beat it.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.84,1:59:34.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（沙赞）
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.57,1:59:52.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,《雷霆沙赞2：众神之怒》
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.70,1:59:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脚疼 还有多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}My feet hurt. How much further?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.66,2:00:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不到十秒前刚问过我一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}About ten seconds less than the last time you asked me.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.33,2:00:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我就是觉得可以把车停近点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I just feel like we could have parked a little bit closer.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.25,2:00:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道我们要来 我不想吓到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't know we're coming, and I didn't want to spook him.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.71,2:00:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,“吓到他” 他是超级英雄 又不是鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Spook him." He's a superhero, not a deer.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.25,2:00:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.63,2:00:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你去告诉沃勒 虽然她认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you can tell Waller that even though.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.80,2:00:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人可以成为团队新成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}she thinks this guy could be a good addition to the team,
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.14,2:00:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们没有见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}we never actually met him.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.68,2:00:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你穿了双很破的鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you wore shitty walking shoes.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.81,2:00:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 这是靴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, first of all, they're boots,
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.18,2:00:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外它们不破 很新 就是还没穿合脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're not shitty, they're new. I just haven't had a chance to break them in yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.02,2:00:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.02,2:00:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃勒说这家伙和他们一样强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waller said this guy is as powerful as they come,
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.65,2:00:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有点不成熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a little immature.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.24,2:00:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.32,2:00:34.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（普通无铅汽油）
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.65,2:00:36.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（免费汽油 加油时请检查）
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.45,2:00:38.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（自助服务 严禁吸烟 关闭发动机）
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.29,2:00:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利巴特森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy Batson.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.25,2:00:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? I mean, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.63,2:00:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没听过这个名字 不知道你说的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never heard that name in my life. I don't know who you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.75,2:00:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想见见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'd like to meet that person.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.42,2:00:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他听起来很酷 很搞笑 很有才\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause they sound super cool. And funny. And talented.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.93,2:00:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还帅得很离谱 痞帅痞帅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ridiculously handsome, but, like, in a dangerous way.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.55,2:01:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.51,2:01:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 我们认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. We know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.98,2:01:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.89,2:01:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你就别管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.98,2:01:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.06,2:01:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你也别管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about that either.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.52,2:01:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你的能耐 所以来向你发出邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we've seen what you can do. And we're here to make you an offer.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.15,2:01:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意加入正义…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you like to join the Justice…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.57,2:01:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意 我绝对愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! A thousand times yes!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.70,2:01:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪 我做梦都想加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh! I've been dreaming about this!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.41,2:01:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不全是 我一般会梦到神奇女侠 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, not this exactly. Like, normally, it's Wonder Woman in the dream, but…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.95,2:01:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ew.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.12,2:01:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 还挺顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was easy.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.66,2:01:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入正义协会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Justice Society.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.25,2:01:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 太好了 等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Aweso… Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.29,2:01:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,正义协会 和正义联盟不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Justice Society? Is that different than the Justice League?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.09,2:01:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 正义协会和正义联盟不是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. The Justice Society is different than the Justice League.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.30,2:01:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它们名字不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of how words work.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.09,2:01:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想加入神奇女侠的组织 是你们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to be in the Wonder Woman group. So, that's you guys, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.51,2:01:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.47,2:01:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么对神奇女侠这么执着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you so obsessed with Wonder Woman, dude?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.52,2:01:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.56,2:01:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.48,2:01:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.60,2:01:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我鞋不舒服 就在这等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna wait here, 'cause of the shoes.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.69,2:01:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能开车过来接我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you drive by and get me?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.69,2:01:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我就提点建设性的意见啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, just a little constructive criticism.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.99,2:01:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两拨完全不同的超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty confusing that there are two separate groups.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.28,2:01:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让人很困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}of superheroes.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.49,2:02:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两拨人完全不相干 但名字里都有正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}that are totally unaffiliated, but both have "Justice" in their name, you know.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.66,2:02:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 你们有没有考虑过重塑品牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, have you guys ever thought about doing a rebranding of sorts?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.45,2:02:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 看 我随手在同义词词典上搜了搜\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause just a quick search on Thesaurus.com,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.46,2:02:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择可多了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got so many options, man.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.96,2:02:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如权威协会 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, "Authority Society." Eh?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.79,2:02:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,信条协会 好傻 很像法律术语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, uh, "Code Society." That's stupid. These are, like, legal terms.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.51,2:02:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇者协会\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Avenger Society."
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.01,2:02:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that, for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.42,2:08:33.42,Title,0,0,0,0,,《雷霆沙赞2：众神之怒》
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.95,2:09:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好哇 好哇 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.45,2:09:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,又见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We meet again.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.25,2:09:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底跑哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where in the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.87,2:09:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想实施完美计划 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}To implement the perfect plan, Doctor,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.08,2:09:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得耐心一点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}one must have patience.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.59,2:09:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.76,2:09:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经过了两年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been two goddamn years!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.55,2:09:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但时间不过是大脑的把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. But what is time but a trick of the mind?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.35,2:09:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,和无意义的尺度\N{\fnArial\fs30}A meaningless measure.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.06,2:09:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我现在57岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I'm 57 years old.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.56,2:09:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,困在混凝土盒子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stuck in a concrete box.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.35,2:09:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,周围全是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}surrounded by lunatics.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.85,2:09:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着一只虫子来实施含糊的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for a worm to enact some, what, vague plan I've been told absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:30.06,2:09:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己还不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing about?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:31.44,2:09:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在路上花了很长时间 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes me a very long time to get places, okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.15,2:09:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有腿 也没有翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not have legs, I do not have wings,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.03,2:09:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能无休无止地蠕动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just slither around endlessly.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.58,2:09:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但快到头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not for long.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.75,2:09:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.92,2:09:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有一件事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one more thing I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.09,2:09:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.63,2:09:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.63,2:09:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, goddamn it!
